00:12:58.280 --> 00:12:59.600
I mean, I don't know.
我是说，我不知道。

331
00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:01.720
How do they fit that on the plaque?
他们怎么把这些字塞进牌匾里的？

332
00:13:01.720 --> 00:13:02.580
I don't know.
我不知道。

333
00:13:02.920 --> 00:13:06.140
I would watch that woman play the xylophone all day long.
我愿意看那个女人敲一整天的木琴。

334
00:13:08.020 --> 00:13:13.100
Lady, I kind of thought that if they remade this movie today, that you and I would play
女士，我甚至在想，如果这部电影今天被翻拍，你和我将会出演

335
00:13:13.100 --> 00:13:14.220
Miss McGee and Blanche.
麦吉小姐和布兰奇。

336
00:13:14.220 --> 00:13:16.220
I want to be Blanche so badly.
我太想演布兰奇了。

337
00:13:16.220 --> 00:13:17.620
I want to be Miss McGee.
我想演麦吉小姐。

338
00:13:17.680 --> 00:13:20.480
I want you to swat at me as I continue playing the xylophone.
我希望当我继续敲木琴时，你会冲过来拍打我。

339
00:13:20.520 --> 00:13:21.900
I'll be so flummoxed.
我会不知所措的。

340
00:13:22.020 --> 00:13:22.380
Ugh.
呃。

341
00:13:22.380 --> 00:13:27.000
Well, anyway, these two agree it's going to be a great school year.
不管怎样，这两个人一致认为这将是棒极了的一学年。

342
00:13:27.740 --> 00:13:33.320
And just as they agree, you hear the sound of screeching tires and a crash.
就在他们达成一致时，你听到了轮胎刺耳的摩擦声和撞击声。

343
00:13:33.780 --> 00:13:37.820
And we cut to the pink ladies arriving in their pink car.
镜头切换到粉红女郎们坐着她们的粉色汽车抵达。

344
00:13:38.060 --> 00:13:39.660
Yeah, they're not good at driving, guys.
对，她们开车技术真不行，各位。

345
00:13:39.840 --> 00:13:42.460
They screech and come to a halt several times in the movie.
她们在电影里多次发出刺耳的急刹车并停下。

346
00:13:42.720 --> 00:13:44.260
But their leader is late.
但她们的领袖迟到了。

347
00:13:44.700 --> 00:13:45.180
Yeah.
是啊。

348
00:13:45.180 --> 00:13:46.860
Why didn't she ride with them?
她为什么不跟她们一起坐车？

349
00:13:46.980 --> 00:13:48.180
Why can't they pick her up?
她们为什么不能去接她？

350
00:13:48.740 --> 00:13:50.340
Maybe she didn't like to ride with them.
也许她不喜欢和她们一起坐车。

351
00:13:50.500 --> 00:13:51.180
I don't know.
我不知道。

352
00:13:51.580 --> 00:13:53.040
Maybe she doesn't trust their driving.
也许她不信任他们的车技。

353
00:13:53.360 --> 00:13:54.280
Maybe not.
也许吧。

354
00:13:54.540 --> 00:13:59.580
But this is our first glimpse of Michelle Pfeiffer, who was 23 years old when they filmed Grease.
但这是我们首次看到米歇尔·菲佛，她拍摄《油脂》时才23岁。

355
00:13:59.740 --> 00:14:04.500
And now we're going to have our big opening song and dance number back to school again.
现在我们要迎来开场的大型歌舞重返校园。

356
00:14:04.740 --> 00:14:07.720
The choreography for this number is so impressive.
这段歌舞的编排太震撼了。

357
00:14:08.040 --> 00:14:09.980
The song is also really catchy.
这首歌也相当洗脑。

358
00:14:10.340 --> 00:14:14.460
I read that there were 20 main dancers for all the numbers.
我读到过所有歌舞有20名主要舞者。

359
00:14:14.460 --> 00:14:18.240
But then to fill out the whole thing, there were almost 500 cast members.
但为了填满整个场景，有将近500名演员。

360
00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:19.020
I believe it.
我信。

361
00:14:19.300 --> 00:14:20.120
It's unreal.
这太不真实了。

362
00:14:20.260 --> 00:14:23.080
I don't know how you direct something of that scope.
我不知道怎么导演这种规模的场面。

363
00:14:23.240 --> 00:14:24.800
I don't know how you dress everybody.
我不知道怎么给所有人服装造型。

364
00:14:25.140 --> 00:14:27.200
This is an amazing feat for the cast and crew.
这对演员和剧组来说是个了不起的壮举。

365
00:14:27.500 --> 00:14:33.320
What asked what her favorite number was from the movie, the director and choreographer, Patricia Birch, said this.
当被问及她最喜欢电影里的哪段歌舞时，导演兼编舞帕特里夏·伯奇这样说道。

366
00:14:33.960 --> 00:14:38.160
I think the opening of Grease 2 is one of the best things anybody's ever done.
我认为《油脂2》的开场是有史以来最棒的作品之一。

367
00:14:38.340 --> 00:14:43.860
I managed to do what a seven-minute non-stop informational number.
我成功做到了长达七分钟的不间断叙事歌舞。

368
00:14:43.860 --> 00:14:45.480
That's where you got to know them.
这就是你开始了解他们的地方。

369
00:14:45.720 --> 00:14:47.180
I love that opening, yeah.
我很喜欢那个开场，是的。

370
00:14:47.340 --> 00:14:48.240
It's a good opening.
这是一个很好的开场。

371
00:14:48.340 --> 00:14:49.360
I know it's a good opening.
我知道这是一个很好的开场。

372
00:14:49.520 --> 00:14:51.020
I so agree with her.
我太赞同她了。

373
00:14:51.140 --> 00:14:51.760
She is right.
她说得对。

374
00:14:51.940 --> 00:14:53.620
The opening of this movie is perfection.
这部电影的开场堪称完美。

375
00:14:54.440 --> 00:14:57.160
It's everything you want in a big musical number.
它具备了你对大型歌舞的一切期待。

376
00:14:57.340 --> 00:14:59.420
And the song is called Back to School.
这首歌叫《重返校园》。

377
00:14:59.660 --> 00:15:00.860
Let's hear a little bit of it.
我们来听一小段。

378
00:15:01.180 --> 00:15:25.760
Gotta go back, back to school.
得回去，回到学校去。

379
00:15:29.650 --> 00:15:30.750
How catchy is that?
这有多洗脑？

380
00:15:30.950 --> 00:15:31.670
It's so great.
太棒了。

381
00:15:32.390 --> 00:15:37.070
Well, like Patricia Birch said, during this whole dance number, we're meeting everybody.
正如帕特里夏·伯奇所说，在整段舞蹈中，我们在认识每一个人。

382
00:15:37.070 --> 00:15:38.990
We're understanding the relationships.
我们在理解人际关系。

383
00:15:39.270 --> 00:15:40.510
Lady, I have to tell you.
小姐，我得告诉你。

384
00:15:40.650 --> 00:15:40.910
What?
什么？

385
00:15:41.130 --> 00:15:43.550
Do you know who our first collar-up moment is?
你知道我们第一个立起衣领的时刻是谁吗？

386
00:15:43.730 --> 00:15:45.730
Is it when all of the T-birds arrive?
是雷鸟党所有人到达的时候吗？

387
00:15:45.970 --> 00:15:47.270
No, it's actually Stephanie.
不，其实是斯蒂芬妮。

388
00:15:47.910 --> 00:15:49.710
Oh, she puts her collar up.
哦，她竖起了衣领。

389
00:15:49.750 --> 00:15:50.230
Yes.
是的。

390
00:15:50.570 --> 00:15:52.630
She's our first collar-up.
她是我们的第一个立领者。

391
00:15:52.630 --> 00:15:55.870
I will be tracking collars and sunglasses, just so you guys know.
顺便告诉你们，我会一直在留意衣领和太阳镜。

392
00:15:56.010 --> 00:15:56.870
Well, she has both.
嗯，她两样都有。

393
00:15:57.030 --> 00:15:57.650
She does.
确实如此。

394
00:15:58.010 --> 00:16:01.170
And at 3 minutes, 48 seconds, we do meet the Thunderbirds.
在3分48秒时，我们确实见到了雷鸟党。

395
00:16:01.570 --> 00:16:02.310
Here's what you need.
这是你需要知道的。

396
00:16:02.450 --> 00:16:02.910
The Thunderbirds?
雷鸟党？

397
00:16:03.030 --> 00:16:03.810
The Thunderbirds.
雷鸟党。

398
00:16:03.910 --> 00:16:04.710
That's what I put it.
这就是我写的。

399
00:16:05.350 --> 00:16:07.630
I put it in my call, them the Thunderbirds.
我笔记里叫他们雷鸟党。

400
00:16:07.810 --> 00:16:08.930
The T-birds, sorry.
T鸟党，抱歉。

401
00:16:09.610 --> 00:16:10.910
We meet the T-birds.
我们遇到了雷鸟帮。

402
00:16:11.130 --> 00:16:12.590
Here's what you need to be a member.
这是成为成员所需要的东西。

403
00:16:13.050 --> 00:16:16.350
You need a leather jacket that doesn't move with your body, right?
你需要一件僵硬得不随身体动弹的皮夹克，对吧？

404
00:16:16.490 --> 00:16:17.470
It's so stiff.
它太硬了。

405
00:16:18.230 --> 00:16:19.290
You need cigarettes.
你需要香烟。

406
00:16:19.570 --> 00:16:20.230
Lots of them.
很多很多。

407
00:16:20.230 --> 00:16:25.090
You need sunglasses, and you need poofy hair that comes to a point in the middle of your forehead.
你需要太阳镜，还需要蓬松的头发，额头正中间要梳成一个尖角。

408
00:16:25.210 --> 00:16:25.410
Yep.
没错。

409
00:16:25.650 --> 00:16:26.130
You're ready.
你准备好了。

410
00:16:26.370 --> 00:16:27.230
You got it.
就是这样。

411
00:16:27.390 --> 00:16:28.830
Do you want a T-bird breakdown?
你想听听雷鸟帮的详细剖析吗？

412
00:16:29.290 --> 00:16:30.010
I sure do.
我当然想。

413
00:16:30.270 --> 00:16:31.610
Good, because I've got it for you.
很好，因为我都为你准备好了。

414
00:16:32.230 --> 00:16:36.230
Adrian Zamed plays Johnny Nogarelli, the leader of the T-birds.
阿德里安·扎梅德饰演雷鸟帮的老大强尼·诺加雷利。

415
00:16:36.530 --> 00:16:39.390
He was 27 years old when he shot this movie.
他拍这部电影时27岁。

416
00:16:40.030 --> 00:16:43.490
And incidentally, he played Danny Zuko in Grease on Broadway.
顺便说一句，他在百老汇的《油脂》中饰演过丹尼·祖科。

417
00:16:43.870 --> 00:16:47.290
So he actually, like, originated the role of Danny Zuko.
所以他实际上算是丹尼·祖科这一角色的原版演员。

418
00:16:47.410 --> 00:16:49.150
Oh, what a full-circle moment for him.
哦，对他来说真是个圆满的时刻。

419
00:16:49.170 --> 00:16:49.470
I know.
我知道。

420
00:16:49.530 --> 00:16:50.110
That's really cool.
这真的很酷。

421
00:16:50.230 --> 00:16:53.030
Demucci is played by Peter Frenchette.
德穆奇由彼得·弗雷切特饰演。

422
00:16:53.610 --> 00:16:55.850
Goose is played by Christopher McDonald.
古斯由克里斯托弗·麦克唐纳饰演。

423
00:16:56.150 --> 00:16:57.510
You know him from Thelma and Louise.
你可能在《末路狂花》中见过他。

424
00:16:57.690 --> 00:16:58.250
Happy Gilmore.
还有《球c老爹》。

425
00:16:58.690 --> 00:17:00.750
And Davey is played by Leaf Green.
戴维则由利夫·格林饰演。

426
00:17:01.090 --> 00:17:05.710
Now we're going to meet Miss Mason, the hot music teacher.
现在我们要见见梅森小姐，这位性感的美术老师。

427
00:17:05.730 --> 00:17:08.190
She seems to teach a lot of classes.
她似乎教很多门课。

428
00:17:08.430 --> 00:17:09.590
Well, she also teaches English.
嗯，她还教英语。

429
00:17:09.830 --> 00:17:10.110
I know.
我知道。

430
00:17:10.230 --> 00:17:15.050
This was, I was like, she also has time to go to Mr. Stewart's classes, apparently.
当时我就想，显然她还有时间去上斯图尔特先生的课。

431
00:17:15.330 --> 00:17:16.370
Yes, she does and sit in.
没错，她确实去了，还在一旁旁听。

432
00:17:16.490 --> 00:17:18.170
And she also loves hairspray.
而且她还特别喜欢发胶。

433
00:17:18.170 --> 00:17:20.270
She's carrying two cans of hairspray.
她随身带着两罐发胶。

434
00:17:20.430 --> 00:17:21.110
Two, yeah.
两罐，对。

435
00:17:21.110 --> 00:17:22.790
And she's constantly spraying her hair.
而且她不停地往头发上喷发胶。

436
00:17:22.970 --> 00:17:24.390
So don't get too close to her.
所以别离她太近。

437
00:17:24.490 --> 00:17:25.330
You're going to breathe that in.
你会把那些吸进去的。

438
00:17:25.550 --> 00:17:25.890
Yes.
是的。

439
00:17:26.250 --> 00:17:28.730
Miss Mason was played by Connie Stevens, everyone.
梅森小姐由康妮·史蒂文斯饰演，各位。

440
00:17:29.410 --> 00:17:31.890
Connie Stevens, who once dated Elvis Presley.
康妮·史蒂文斯，曾与埃尔维斯·普雷斯利约会过。

441
00:17:31.890 --> 00:17:33.230
I read that.
我读到过这个。

442
00:17:33.430 --> 00:17:33.890
I know.
我知道。

443
00:17:34.110 --> 00:17:35.730
Like, for a while.
而且交往了一段时间。

444
00:17:35.730 --> 00:17:37.050
And she loved him.
她很爱他。

445
00:17:37.230 --> 00:17:37.430
Yeah.
是的。

446
00:17:37.670 --> 00:17:42.050
And then her second husband was once married to Elizabeth Taylor.
然后她的第二任丈夫曾与伊丽莎白·泰勒结过婚。

447
00:17:42.370 --> 00:17:43.090
Eddie Fisher.
埃迪·费舍尔。

448
00:17:43.310 --> 00:17:45.690
Her daughter is Jolie Fisher, the actress.
她的女儿是女演员乔莉·费舍尔。

449
00:17:46.250 --> 00:17:47.290
That's wild.
太疯狂了。

450
00:17:47.470 --> 00:17:47.870
I know.
我知道。

451
00:17:47.870 --> 00:17:51.030
Also, I do want to note, the Thunderbirds are very flirty.
另外，我确实想提一下，雷鸟帮非常爱调情。

452
00:17:51.390 --> 00:17:51.970
The T-Birds, lady.
是T鸟帮，女士。

453
00:17:52.130 --> 00:17:53.570
I don't know why you want to call it.
我不知道你为什么非要那样叫。

454
00:17:53.690 --> 00:17:55.190
They're the T-Birds.
他们是T鸟帮。

455
00:17:55.790 --> 00:17:59.530
I don't know who the Thunderbirds are, but they're not in this movie.
我不知道雷鸟帮是谁，但他们不在这部电影里。

456
00:17:59.650 --> 00:18:00.570
You know what's so funny?
你知道最搞笑的是什么吗？

457
00:18:00.710 --> 00:18:06.170
Is when I was watching this movie, I was babysitting my niece who loves the Thundermans.
就是我在看这部电影的时候，我正在帮我侄女照看孩子，她特别喜欢超人特工家庭。

458
00:18:06.450 --> 00:18:10.490
And I think somehow the Thundermans made it into my brain.
然后我觉得不知怎么的，超人特工家庭就跑进我脑子里了。

459
00:18:10.670 --> 00:18:11.010
Okay.
好吧。

460
00:18:11.010 --> 00:18:13.690
So, anyway, not the Thunderbirds.
所以，总之，不是雷鸟帮。

461
00:18:13.870 --> 00:18:14.070
No.
不是。

462
00:18:14.190 --> 00:18:17.630
The T-Birds are very flirty with Miss Mason.
T鸟帮对梅森小姐非常爱调情。

463
00:18:18.250 --> 00:18:19.270
Oh, yes.
哦，是的。

464
00:18:19.430 --> 00:18:22.530
Miss Mason says, I'd love to see you all in music appreciation.
梅森小姐说，我希望看到你们所有人都来上音乐欣赏课。

465
00:18:22.570 --> 00:18:27.490
And Johnny, he says, I'd like to see all of you in music appreciation.
然后约翰尼说，我也想看到你们所有人都来上音乐欣赏课。

466
00:18:27.490 --> 00:18:29.670
And Miss Mason says, you just might.
接着梅森小姐说，你们还真有可能。

467
00:18:30.650 --> 00:18:32.870
I mean, this is very spicy.
我的意思是，这真的很火辣。

468
00:18:33.310 --> 00:18:34.210
Very spicy.
非常火辣。

469
00:18:34.570 --> 00:18:38.330
They can also see her in English class, which she also teaches, by the way.
他们还可以在英语课上见到她，顺便说一句，这也是她教的。

470
00:18:38.630 --> 00:18:38.890
All right.
好吧。

471
00:18:38.950 --> 00:18:40.390
Well, we're going to get to this credit sequence.
那么，我们要进入片头字幕序列了。

472
00:18:40.390 --> 00:18:44.650
And this is where we're going to meet Maxwell Caulfield, playing Michael.
在这里我们将见到麦克斯韦·考尔菲德，他饰演迈克尔。

473
00:18:44.910 --> 00:18:46.390
He was 22 years old.
他当时22岁。

474
00:18:46.510 --> 00:18:47.470
He gets first billing.
他获得了领衔主演的排位。

475
00:18:47.890 --> 00:18:48.270
Wow.
哇。

476
00:18:48.710 --> 00:18:49.030
Yeah.
是啊。

477
00:18:49.270 --> 00:18:55.930
I would have thought that if they were sort of like of equal experience or status in the
我本来以为，如果他们俩在好莱坞世界里的经验或地位大致相当的话

478
00:18:55.930 --> 00:18:59.890
world of Hollywood, which it seemed like he and Michelle Pfeiffer were, I sort of see
——他与米歇尔·菲佛似乎就是这样——我其实觉得

479
00:18:59.890 --> 00:19:01.790
this as a little bit more of Stephanie's story.
这更像是斯蒂芬妮的故事。

480
00:19:01.970 --> 00:19:03.190
Do you see it as Michael's?
你觉得这是迈克尔的故事吗？

481
00:19:03.350 --> 00:19:06.030
I mean, I think it's the two of them, honestly.
我的意思是，老实说我觉得这是他们两个人的故事。

482
00:19:06.310 --> 00:19:06.530
Yeah.
对。

483
00:19:06.710 --> 00:19:07.570
It's a two-hander.
这是一部双主角电影。

484
00:19:07.670 --> 00:19:08.330
It's a two-hander.
是一部双主角电影。

485
00:19:08.330 --> 00:19:11.770
I did see this very charming interview with Maxwell Caulfield.
我确实看过一个非常迷人的麦克斯韦·考尔菲德的访谈。

486
00:19:11.930 --> 00:19:17.830
A few cast members also shared how supportive the original cast was of Everyone in Grease
一些演员还分享了原版演员对《油脂2》中每个人的支持有多大。

487
00:19:17.830 --> 00:19:18.050
2.
2。

488
00:19:18.330 --> 00:19:19.490
I love hearing that.
听到这个我很高兴。

489
00:19:19.690 --> 00:19:20.850
They said it was like a family.
他们说就像一个大家庭一样。

490
00:19:21.010 --> 00:19:23.930
Like, they were like the big brother, big sister, and they were like the little siblings.
就像，他们就像大哥哥和大姐姐，而他们就像小弟弟和小妹妹。

491
00:19:24.170 --> 00:19:29.230
And that Olivia Newton-John, in particular, hosted a few parties and invited all the caSt.
尤其是奥莉维亚·牛顿-约翰，她举办了几场派对，邀请了所有演员。

492
00:19:29.890 --> 00:19:30.330
Wow.
哇。

493
00:19:30.530 --> 00:19:31.850
Way to go, Olivia Newton-John.
干得好，奥莉维亚·牛顿-约翰。

494
00:19:32.190 --> 00:19:32.430
I know.
我知道。

495
00:19:32.650 --> 00:19:34.530
Well, you know, her boyfriend was in the movie.
嗯，你知道的，她男朋友也演了这部电影。

496
00:19:34.670 --> 00:19:35.230
I know.
我知道。

497
00:19:35.370 --> 00:19:36.050
We'll get to it.
我们会讲到这一点的。

498
00:19:36.070 --> 00:19:36.730
We'll get to it.
我们会讲到这一点的。

499
00:19:36.990 --> 00:19:37.410
All right.
好了。

500
00:19:37.450 --> 00:19:38.510
We're going to meet Michael.
我们要去见迈克尔了。

501
00:19:38.670 --> 00:19:40.330
We're going to learn he's Sandy's cousin.
我们会发现他是桑迪的表弟。

502
00:19:40.670 --> 00:19:43.230
And he's going to run into Frenchie.
然后他会偶遇弗兰奇。

503
00:19:43.690 --> 00:19:44.130
Yes.
没错。

504
00:19:44.130 --> 00:19:45.270
We love Frenchie.
我们都很喜欢弗兰奇。

505
00:19:45.370 --> 00:19:46.650
That's a flashback character.
那是个闪回出场的人物。

506
00:19:46.830 --> 00:19:48.070
Played by Didi Kahn.
由迪迪·康饰演。

507
00:19:48.970 --> 00:19:52.410
Frenchie explains everything that's happened since she left Rydell.
弗兰奇解释了她离开雷戴尔之后发生的一切。

508
00:19:52.410 --> 00:19:56.950
We find out she flunked out of beauty school because in tinting class, her hair turned pink,
我们发现她美容学校没能毕业，因为在上染发课时，她的头发变成了粉红色，

509
00:19:56.950 --> 00:20:00.190
and that now the most important thing in her life is skin care.
而现在她生命中最重要的事情是皮肤护理。

510
00:20:00.190 --> 00:20:04.710
So she's back at Rydell to get her chemistry and to mix her own cosmetics.
所以她回到了雷戴尔修读化学课，以便调配自己的化妆品。

511
00:20:05.010 --> 00:20:09.470
This is a lot of information about a character who is going to disappear halfway through the film.
对于一个在电影过半时就会消失的角色来说，这信息量也太大了。

512
00:20:09.810 --> 00:20:12.470
She's just got to establish why she's back at high school.
她只是得交代清楚自己为什么重回高中。

513
00:20:12.650 --> 00:20:13.270
I guess.
我想是吧。

514
00:20:13.490 --> 00:20:15.230
But she probably could have done it in one sentence.
但她其实完全可以用一句话就说清楚。

515
00:20:15.410 --> 00:20:16.030
Yeah, it's a lot.
对啊，内容确实挺多。

516
00:20:16.050 --> 00:20:16.750
No judgment.
没有要批判的意思。

517
00:20:17.230 --> 00:20:17.350
JuSt.
只是随口说说。

518
00:20:17.890 --> 00:20:21.290
Well, listen, through all of this, we're still dancing.
好了，听着，在这一切过程里，我们依然在跳舞。

519
00:20:21.290 --> 00:20:22.230
We're still singing.
我们依然在歌唱。

520
00:20:22.250 --> 00:20:24.770
And now we're going to hear the Pink Lady's Pledge.
而现在我们要听到粉红女士誓言了。

521
00:20:25.450 --> 00:20:27.910
And I thought we should hear it because I love it.
我觉得我们应该听听这个，因为我太喜欢了。

522
00:20:28.030 --> 00:20:29.430
And I can't get it out of my head.
而且这旋律一直在我脑海里挥之不去。

523
00:20:30.050 --> 00:20:31.530
The Pink Lady's Pledge.
粉红女士誓言。

524
00:20:31.670 --> 00:20:33.090
To act cool.
行为要酷。

525
00:20:33.350 --> 00:20:34.310
To look cool.
外表要酷。

526
00:20:34.950 --> 00:20:36.510
And to be cool.
心灵要酷。

527
00:20:36.830 --> 00:20:38.150
Till death do us part.
直到死神将我们分离。

528
00:20:38.710 --> 00:20:39.290
Think pink.
保持粉红。

529
00:20:43.210 --> 00:20:43.630
Yeah.
没错。

530
00:20:43.930 --> 00:20:45.270
That's the Pink Lady's Pledge.
这就是粉红女士誓言。

531
00:20:45.510 --> 00:20:48.530
Do you feel like Victoria's Secrets kind of stole the think pink?
你觉得维多利亚的秘密是不是有点剽窃了“保持粉红”这个概念？

532
00:20:49.050 --> 00:20:50.050
I think they did.
我觉得他们就是抄的。

533
00:20:50.330 --> 00:20:50.570
Yeah.
对啊。

534
00:20:50.690 --> 00:20:52.250
I've been thinking about that for days.
这件事我琢磨好几天了。

535
00:20:52.470 --> 00:20:52.610
Yeah.
对啊。

536
00:20:52.830 --> 00:20:53.170
Me too.
我也是。

537
00:20:53.270 --> 00:20:54.130
I'm glad you said it.
很高兴你把这话说出来了。

538
00:20:54.270 --> 00:20:55.650
Well, there it is.
好了，事情就是这样。

539
00:20:55.730 --> 00:20:56.290
It's on record.
这可是有据可查的。

540
00:20:56.690 --> 00:20:58.270
Here's your Pink Lady's breakdown.
接下来是粉红女士的成员介绍。

541
00:20:58.530 --> 00:20:58.710
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

542
00:20:58.890 --> 00:21:02.230
Stephanie Zanoni, leader of the Pink Ladies, played by Michelle Pfeiffer.
斯蒂芬妮·扎诺尼，粉红女士的领袖，由米歇尔·菲佛饰演。

543
00:21:02.950 --> 00:21:05.450
Paulette Rebchuk, played by Lorna Luft.
保莱特·雷布丘克，由洛娜·卢夫饰演。

544
00:21:05.950 --> 00:21:08.290
Rhonda Ritter, played by Alison Price.
朗达·里特，由艾莉森·普莱斯饰演。

545
00:21:08.750 --> 00:21:11.450
Sharon Cooper, played by Maureen Teefy.
莎伦·库珀，由莫琳·蒂菲饰演。

546
00:21:11.990 --> 00:21:16.830
And Dolores Rebchuk, who is Paulette's little sister, played by Pamela Adlon.
还有德洛丽丝·雷布丘克，她是保莱特的妹妹，由帕梅拉·阿德龙饰演。

547
00:21:17.070 --> 00:21:21.490
And now we're going to see the coach, played by Sid Caesar, another returning character.
现在我们要看到教练了，由希德·凯撒饰演，又一个回归的角色。

548
00:21:21.950 --> 00:21:22.730
Coach Calhoun.
卡尔霍恩教练。

549
00:21:22.870 --> 00:21:23.250
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

550
00:21:23.730 --> 00:21:24.850
There's more dancing.
还有更多舞蹈场面。

551
00:21:25.110 --> 00:21:26.230
So much dancing.
好多舞蹈啊。

552
00:21:27.310 --> 00:21:28.610
Everyone dances inside.
每个人都在里面跳舞。

553
00:21:29.050 --> 00:21:31.290
The T-birds stop to comb their hair, though.
不过，雷鸟党人停下来梳了梳头发。

554
00:21:31.710 --> 00:21:32.990
That's very important to them.
这对他们来说非常重要。

555
00:21:33.170 --> 00:21:33.430
Yeah.
是啊。

556
00:21:33.430 --> 00:21:34.610
They have to fix their hair a lot.
他们得经常整理发型。

557
00:21:34.770 --> 00:21:36.470
And then this whole thing ends.
然后整场戏就结束了。

558
00:21:36.650 --> 00:21:39.990
This is like a moment that is burned in my brain from my childhood.
这就像是我童年时期烙印在脑海里的一个瞬间。

559
00:21:40.510 --> 00:21:46.630
It ends with a guy running across the lawn and just diving through an open window.
结局是一个家伙跑过草坪，直接跳进了一扇开着的窗户。

560
00:21:46.790 --> 00:21:47.010
Yeah.
是啊。

561
00:21:47.170 --> 00:21:47.850
Of the high school.
高中的窗户。

562
00:21:48.230 --> 00:21:49.870
And then that ends on like a downbeat.
然后以一个有点沉闷的节奏结束。

563
00:21:49.990 --> 00:21:50.550
It's like boom.
就像是“轰”的一声。

564
00:21:51.150 --> 00:21:51.450
Yeah.
是啊。

565
00:21:51.590 --> 00:21:53.290
And now we've opened the movie.
现在我们正式开场了。

566
00:21:53.450 --> 00:21:53.630
Yeah.
是啊。

567
00:21:53.790 --> 00:21:55.850
And there's a cello hanging from the flagpole.
旗杆上挂着一把大提琴。

568
00:21:56.170 --> 00:21:56.430
Yeah.
是啊。

569
00:21:56.430 --> 00:21:57.830
A bunch of kids are hanging out the windows.
一群孩子挂在窗户外面。

570
00:21:58.050 --> 00:22:01.530
This school is like a little wackadoodle.
这所学校有点古怪。

571
00:22:01.530 --> 00:22:05.270
Well, at the lockers, the pink ladies discuss nose jobs.
好吧，在储物柜旁，粉红淑女党在讨论整鼻子。

572
00:22:05.450 --> 00:22:09.910
They discuss who JFK would rather be with, if it's Jackie O or Marilyn Monroe.
她们讨论肯尼迪宁愿和谁在一起，是杰奎琳·奥纳西斯还是玛丽莲·梦露。

573
00:22:10.790 --> 00:22:12.990
Johnny, the head of the T-birds, comes over.
雷鸟党的老大强尼走了过来。

574
00:22:13.150 --> 00:22:15.570
And Stephanie has to remind him it's over, Johnny.
斯蒂芬妮不得不提醒他：一切都结束了，强尼。

575
00:22:15.790 --> 00:22:16.110
Yeah.
是啊。

576
00:22:16.210 --> 00:22:16.490
We're over.
我们结束了。

577
00:22:16.490 --> 00:22:18.730
However, Paulette clearly likes Johnny.
然而，保莱特显然对强尼有好感。

578
00:22:19.170 --> 00:22:20.430
Nine minutes, 13 seconds.
9分13秒。

579
00:22:20.430 --> 00:22:25.850
We have another very big collar up moment, courtesy of Johnny in his stiff leather jacket.
我们迎来了又一个强尼竖起硬皮夹克领子的标志性时刻。

580
00:22:26.370 --> 00:22:27.270
That's great.
太棒了。

581
00:22:27.870 --> 00:22:31.950
Lewis is going to come over and give Sharon a big old smooch at the lockers.
刘易斯走过来，在储物柜旁狠狠地亲了莎朗一口。

582
00:22:32.230 --> 00:22:32.710
I know.
我知道。

583
00:22:32.970 --> 00:22:33.750
Real big kiss.
超级热烈的一个吻。

584
00:22:33.910 --> 00:22:34.150
I know.
我知道。

585
00:22:34.190 --> 00:22:34.990
These two are on.
这俩人现在是一对了。

586
00:22:35.570 --> 00:22:40.430
There's a lot of people kissing in close proximity to other people in this movie.
这部电影里有很多人在别人附近旁若无人地亲热。

587
00:22:40.550 --> 00:22:45.650
So if you don't like PDA, this movie is a little bit of a cringe fest for you.
所以如果你不喜欢当众亲热，这部电影对你来说可能有点尴尬。

588
00:22:45.650 --> 00:22:47.050
This is not the high school for you.
这绝不是适合你的高中。

589
00:22:47.190 --> 00:22:47.350
No.
没错。

590
00:22:48.370 --> 00:22:51.930
Well, Stephanie starts to go to class, but then she realizes she's wearing jeans.
好吧，斯蒂芬妮正要去上课，却发现自己穿着牛仔裤。

591
00:22:51.930 --> 00:22:54.750
And so she goes to her locker to change into a skirt.
于是她去储物柜换裙子。

592
00:22:55.030 --> 00:22:55.230
Yeah.
是啊。

593
00:22:55.270 --> 00:22:57.250
She's got like these little, like, what do they call them?
她穿着那种……那叫什么来着？

594
00:22:57.330 --> 00:22:58.890
Pedal pusher, like leggings, right?
七分裤，类似于打底裤吧？

595
00:22:58.890 --> 00:23:00.250
Yeah, like little cigarette pants.
对，就像那种紧身窄管裤。

596
00:23:00.450 --> 00:23:01.230
Cigarette pants.
窄管裤。

597
00:23:01.450 --> 00:23:10.910
Well, I got to wondering, was this a real thing that girls in the 60s couldn't wear pants to school, even public school?
嗯，我不禁想知道，这是真实存在的吗？60年代的女生甚至不能穿裤子去公立学校上学？

598
00:23:11.030 --> 00:23:11.270
Yeah.
是的。

599
00:23:11.450 --> 00:23:15.410
I noticed Stephanie looks around and sees all the other girls in skirts and then quickly,
我注意到斯蒂芬妮环顾四周，看到其他女生都穿着裙子，然后迅速

600
00:23:15.990 --> 00:23:17.070
grabs her skirt.
抓起她的裙子。

601
00:23:17.310 --> 00:23:18.410
I deep dived it.
我深入研究过了。

602
00:23:18.630 --> 00:23:19.810
What was the rule?
规定是什么？

603
00:23:20.010 --> 00:23:23.310
I found this amazing Reddit thread called Ask Old People.
我发现了 Reddit 上一个叫“问老年人”的精彩帖子。

604
00:23:23.630 --> 00:23:24.050
Oh.
哦。

605
00:23:24.250 --> 00:23:26.730
One of the threads was about this very subject.
其中一个帖子正是关于这个主题的。

606
00:23:26.950 --> 00:23:31.630
People asking, was it a rule that girls had to wear skirts to school?
人们在问，女生上学必须穿裙子是规定吗？

607
00:23:32.670 --> 00:23:35.290
And according to the old people, the answer is yes.
根据老年人们的说法，答案是肯定的。

608
00:23:35.590 --> 00:23:40.070
Prior to 1970, girls had to wear dresses or skirts that went down to their knees.
在 1970 年之前，女生必须穿及膝的连衣裙或裙子。

609
00:23:40.390 --> 00:23:40.810
Ooh.
哦。

610
00:23:41.110 --> 00:23:44.410
One person said the hem of the dress had to touch the floor if you were kneeling.
有人说，如果你跪下的话，裙摆必须触到地面。

611
00:23:45.370 --> 00:23:45.830
Okay.
好吧。

612
00:23:45.830 --> 00:23:47.470
That's how you knew if it was the right length.
这就是你如何判断长度是否合适的方法。

613
00:23:48.050 --> 00:23:52.530
Girls could not wear pants, jeans, shorts, and also no open-toed shoes.
女生不能穿长裤、牛仔裤、短裤，也不能穿露趾鞋。

614
00:23:53.210 --> 00:23:58.410
One woman said she had to wear pantyhose, quote, in an un-air-conditioned classroom in Texas.
有个女人说她不得不穿连裤袜，“引述自德州一间没有空调的教室”。

615
00:23:59.430 --> 00:24:02.930
And then I found this comment in the thread, and I loved it.
然后我在帖子里看到了这条评论，我太喜欢了。

616
00:24:03.810 --> 00:24:05.350
This old person said,
这位老人家说，

617
00:24:05.350 --> 00:24:10.670
I graduated from high school in 1970, and it was only during the last few months of that year
我在 1970 年高中毕业，直到那年的最后几个月

618
00:24:10.670 --> 00:24:12.450
that I ever wore pants to school.
我才第一次穿着裤子去上学。

619
00:24:12.910 --> 00:24:16.270
A girl named Nancy just showed up one day in pants.
有个叫南希的女孩有一天突然穿着裤子出现了。

620
00:24:16.390 --> 00:24:17.310
Go, Nancy!
加油，南希！

621
00:24:17.650 --> 00:24:21.290
And when she got sent to the principal's office, she calmly made her case.
当她被送到校长办公室时，她镇定自若地陈述了自己的理由。

622
00:24:21.810 --> 00:24:25.470
At some point, he, of course it was a he, was persuaded.
在某个时刻，他——当然是个男的——被说服了。

623
00:24:25.930 --> 00:24:30.830
I never knew what she said exactly, but I know she was a smart, even-tempered girl
我从来不知道她到底说了什么，但我知道她是个聪明的、性格温和的女孩，

624
00:24:30.830 --> 00:24:32.290
who had an older sister.
她还有一个姐姐。

625
00:24:32.290 --> 00:24:35.890
They were being raised by their dad because their mom had died,
她们由父亲抚养长大，因为母亲去世了，

626
00:24:36.090 --> 00:24:37.910
which gave them both a sort of gravity.
这让她们两个都有一种不同寻常的稳重。

627
00:24:38.610 --> 00:24:42.850
After this conversation with the principal, she went back to class and finished her day,
在与校长谈话后，她回到了课堂并上完了当天的课，

628
00:24:42.890 --> 00:24:47.150
and they made an announcement that girls could now wear pants.
然后他们宣布女生现在可以穿裤子了。

629
00:24:47.490 --> 00:24:48.010
Wow.
哇。

630
00:24:48.650 --> 00:24:53.990
I can't really describe what an impact that event had on all of us, but me in particular.
我无法真切地描述那件事对我们所有人的影响，尤其是对我。

631
00:24:54.390 --> 00:24:55.930
You could ask why.
你可以质疑。

632
00:24:56.130 --> 00:24:57.430
You could make an argument.
你可以据理力争。

633
00:24:57.710 --> 00:25:00.750
You could persuade people with power over you to change.
你可以说服那些手握权柄的人做出改变。

634
00:25:00.750 --> 00:25:02.970
That girl was a legend.
那个女孩是个传奇。

635
00:25:03.370 --> 00:25:05.850
Wherever you are, Nancy, thanks.
不管你在哪里，南希，谢谢你。

636
00:25:06.810 --> 00:25:07.870
That's awesome.
太棒了。

637
00:25:08.470 --> 00:25:09.270
Pretty cool.
相当酷。

638
00:25:09.850 --> 00:25:14.390
Incidentally, this thread also said that boys had to wear shirts with collars they had to
顺便说一句，这个帖子还说男生必须穿带领子的衬衫，并且必须

639
00:25:14.390 --> 00:25:18.650
be tucked in, and their hair couldn't be longer than the tops of their ears.
塞进裤子里，头发不能长过耳尖。

640
00:25:19.090 --> 00:25:22.510
Maybe that's why the T-Birds put all their hair up so high.
也许这就是“雷鸟”党把头发梳得那么高的原因。

641
00:25:22.710 --> 00:25:24.650
And then let it droop down their forehead.
然后让它们垂在前额上。

642
00:25:24.910 --> 00:25:25.190
Right.
没错。

643
00:25:25.450 --> 00:25:27.750
There was no rule about forehead hair.
没有关于额头头发的规定。

644
00:25:27.890 --> 00:25:29.610
They could compensate in the front.
他们可以在前面进行弥补。

645
00:25:29.610 --> 00:25:30.330
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

646
00:25:30.450 --> 00:25:32.330
They weren't allowed to have facial hair either.
他们也不被允许留面部毛发。

647
00:25:32.790 --> 00:25:37.910
Well, now Michael is trying to find a locker, and he's chosen one of the T-Birds lockers,
