She said the salary was too low and they didn't have a finished script.
她说薪水太低，而且剧本还没写完。

853
00:34:51.580 --> 00:34:53.520
Cher was like, I think I'm going to pass.
雪儿当时说，我想我还是算了吧。

854
00:34:53.640 --> 00:34:54.260
I think I'm out.
我想我不演了。

855
00:34:55.060 --> 00:34:56.740
Well, Lorna Luft crushes it.
不过，洛娜·劳夫的表现太棒了。

856
00:34:56.960 --> 00:35:00.640
There is a dance move in this number I need to talk about.
这个歌舞段落里有个舞蹈动作我得好好说说过。

