搞得我也想学那个舞蹈动作。

868
00:35:20.320 --> 00:35:25.100
Also, a lot of people online called bulls**t on dancing on the bowling lanes.
另外，网上很多人对在保龄球道上跳舞提出了质疑。

869
00:35:25.400 --> 00:35:27.020
This is what some folks said.
有些网友是这么说的。

870
00:35:27.580 --> 00:35:31.500
Quote, everybody is dancing at the bowling alley and even dancing on the alleys.
原话是：“每个人都在保龄球馆跳舞，甚至在球道上跳舞。”

871
00:35:31.640 --> 00:35:35.940
The alleys in a bowling alley are heavily waxed, so the bowling balls don't have friction
“保龄球馆的球道打了厚厚的蜡，这样保龄球滚动时才没有摩擦力。”

872
