Well, I want to offer, maybe this is why they can spin so much.
不过我想说，也许这就是他们能转那么多圈的原因吧。

875
00:35:45.760 --> 00:35:47.240
They spin with ease.
他们转起来太轻松了。

876
00:35:47.440 --> 00:35:49.260
I think they would be busting their ass.
我觉得他们肯定会摔个狗吃屎。

877
00:35:49.420 --> 00:35:50.700
Many people wrote about that.
很多人都讨论过这件事。

878
00:35:51.060 --> 00:35:55.560
One other thing I'd love to share is that Michelle Pfeiffer said in an interview that she kept
