There were a lot of pages in this book.
这本书里有好多页呢。

891
00:36:26.760 --> 00:36:31.280
Look, I have to think that it addresses more than bowling.
你看，我猜它讲的肯定不只是保龄球。

892
00:36:31.540 --> 00:36:32.440
I hope so.
但愿如此。

893
00:36:32.840 --> 00:36:36.640
But also, wow, that there's even a section.
不过话说回来，哇，居然还有这样一个章节。

894
00:36:37.320 --> 00:36:40.360
Well, inside, everyone is now done bowling.
在里面，大家现在都打完保龄球了。

895
