And he says, so that's the way it's going to be now, huh, Miss Independent?
然后他说，原来你现在是这个态度了啊，独立女性？

906
00:37:10.000 --> 00:37:12.840
And she says, yeah, independent.
她说，没错，独立。

907
00:37:13.320 --> 00:37:16.260
I kiss who I want, when I want.
我想亲谁就亲谁，想什么时候亲就什么时候亲。

908
00:37:16.500 --> 00:37:20.180
I could kiss the next guy who walks through that door if I want.
我甚至可以去亲下一个走进这扇门的人，如果我想的话。

909
00:37:20.180 --> 00:37:22.560
And he says, be my gueSt.
他说，请便。

910
00:37:23.060 --> 00:37:25.460
Well, guess who walks in right at that moment?
结果你猜这时候谁进来了？

911
00:37:25.600 --> 00:37:25.980
Michael.
迈克尔。

912
00:37:26.460 --> 00:37:28.380
And she lays one on him.
然后她直接吻了他。

913
00:37:28.920 --> 00:37:29.760
He's shocked.
他震惊了。

914
00:37:29.920 --> 00:37:30.820
Everyone's shocked.
所有人都震惊了。

915
00:37:31.320 --> 00:37:33.860
Then she walks over to the group and she says, let's eat.
接着她走向大家说，开饭吧。

916
00:37:34.860 --> 00:37:35.380
Wow.
哇。

917
00:37:35.580 --> 00:37:40.620
This scene, that whole line of, that's the way it's going to be now, huh, Miss Independent?
这一幕，还有那句台词“原来你现在是这个态度了啊，独立女性？”

918
00:37:41.100 --> 00:37:42.980
She's like, yeah, independent.
她说，没错，独立。

919
00:37:43.300 --> 00:37:46.880
My sister and I used to do the dialogue from this scene.
我和我姐以前经常对这一幕的台词。

920
00:37:47.000 --> 00:37:47.600
That's adorable.
太有爱了。

921
00:37:47.600 --> 00:37:49.640
That's some of my favorite dialogue from the movie.
那是我最喜欢的电影台词之一。

922
00:37:49.860 --> 00:37:51.160
That's so cute, lady.
太可爱了，这位女士。

923
00:37:51.480 --> 00:37:53.760
Well, our next big scene is a new day at school.
好了，我们下一个大场面是学校新的一天。

924
00:37:54.060 --> 00:37:55.940
We're going to meet Mr. Stewart.
我们要见斯图尔特先生了。

