Well, now Louis is going to sneak into Michael's uncle's nuclear fallout shelter to try to trick
好了，现在路易斯要溜进迈克尔叔叔的核避难所，试图诱骗

1440
01:01:30.640 --> 01:01:32.280
Sharon into sleeping with him.
莎伦和他上床。

1441
01:01:32.460 --> 01:01:32.740
Yeah.
对。

1442
01:01:32.740 --> 01:01:37.400
Yeah, he has the other T-birds go outside the shelter and crank, like, the alarm.
对，他让其他雷鸟帮成员走到避难所外面，然后拉响警报。

1443
01:01:37.540 --> 01:01:38.160
The siren.
那个警报器。

1444
01:01:38.560 --> 01:01:38.610
Yeah.
对。

1445
01:01:38.860 --> 01:01:39.100
Yeah.
对。

1446
01:01:39.560 --> 01:01:39.880
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1447
01:01:40.360 --> 01:01:43.180
They're going to have this duet called Let's Do It For Our Country.
他们会有一首对唱叫《为了国家我们干吧》。

1448
01:01:43.600 --> 01:01:43.880
Yeah.
对。

1449
01:01:43.880 --> 01:01:45.420
You can imagine what that entails.
你可以想象那意味着什么。

1450
01:01:46.100 --> 01:01:46.500
Yes.
是的。

1451
01:01:47.320 --> 01:01:50.120
She's going to get wise to him at the end, and she's like, I'm out of here.
她最后总会看清他的真面目，然后就像是，我才不伺候了。

1452
01:01:50.240 --> 01:01:50.900
She's upset.
她很沮丧。

1453
01:01:51.140 --> 01:01:54.640
But there's this whole thing where she's, like, wrapping him up in gauze and stuff.
但这里有个情节，就是她用纱布之类的东西把他缠起来。

1454
01:01:54.720 --> 01:01:56.860
She thinks she's healing his—
她以为自己在给他疗伤——

1455
01:01:56.860 --> 01:01:57.980
Like Florence Nightingale or something.
就像南丁格尔或者别的什么人。

1456
01:01:57.980 --> 01:02:03.000
Before he goes off to war, I guess she's going to wrap him in some gauze and then have sex
在他去参军之前，我猜她会用纱布把他缠起来，然后和他

1457
01:02:03.000 --> 01:02:03.340
with him.
发生关系。

1458
01:02:03.780 --> 01:02:04.680
I don't know.
我不知道。

1459
01:02:05.580 --> 01:02:06.380
I'm not sure.
我不太确定。

1460
01:02:07.020 --> 01:02:07.440
All right.
好吧。

1461
01:02:07.580 --> 01:02:07.860
You know.
你知道的。

1462
01:02:08.080 --> 01:02:10.300
Well, now we're at the gas station.
好了，现在我们来到加油站。

1463
01:02:10.480 --> 01:02:10.800
Yes.
是的。

1464
01:02:10.900 --> 01:02:13.520
The only mechanic in this whole movie is Stephanie.
整部电影里唯一的机械师就是斯蒂芬妮。

1465
01:02:13.780 --> 01:02:15.100
It's her dad's gas station.
这是她爸爸的加油站。

1466
01:02:15.280 --> 01:02:18.000
Because in Greece, you know, the greasers are mechanics.
因为你知道，在希腊，那些飞车党都是修理工。

1467
01:02:18.340 --> 01:02:18.680
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1468
01:02:19.500 --> 01:02:21.520
So Stephanie is that for this movie.
所以在这部电影里，斯蒂芬妮就是这样的人。

1469
01:02:22.020 --> 01:02:23.340
Well, she's very overwhelmed.
好吧，她快应接不暇了。

1470
01:02:23.520 --> 01:02:26.380
She has multiple people asking her for things.
有好几个人都在找她帮忙。

1471
01:02:26.860 --> 01:02:29.620
They're very annoyed patrons at this gas station.
加油站里的这些顾客很不高兴。

1472
01:02:29.840 --> 01:02:30.000
Yes.
是的。

1473
01:02:30.740 --> 01:02:33.480
I don't understand why she doesn't finish one thing at a time.
我不明白她为什么不一次只做一件事。

1474
01:02:33.640 --> 01:02:36.520
She starts three different customers' things.
她同时应付三个不同的顾客。

1475
01:02:36.760 --> 01:02:37.060
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1476
01:02:37.200 --> 01:02:39.400
Like, just finish it and then move to the next person.
比如，先把一件事做完，再去应付下一个。

1477
01:02:39.420 --> 01:02:43.260
But instead, she's got three unfinished businesses all yelling at her.
但她倒好，同时有三摊没做完的事，而且都在冲她大吼大叫。

1478
01:02:43.360 --> 01:02:44.240
All yelling at her.
都在冲她大吼大叫。

1479
01:02:44.420 --> 01:02:47.020
Gas is, I would like to point out, 50 cents a gallon.
我要指出的是，油价是每加仑50美分。

1480
01:02:47.640 --> 01:02:48.420
Michael pulls up.
迈克尔把车开过来了。

1481
01:02:48.480 --> 01:02:49.860
He puts some gas in his motorcycle.
他的摩托车加了点油。

1482
01:02:49.860 --> 01:02:51.140
He says, what do I owe you?
他说，我该付你多少钱？

1483
01:02:51.360 --> 01:02:51.720
Yeah.
是啊。

1484
01:02:51.780 --> 01:02:53.600
Because he has to be very quiet husky.
因为他必须用那种低沉沙哑的嗓音说话。

1485
01:02:53.700 --> 01:02:54.820
He is a little bit of Batman.
他有点像蝙蝠侠。

1486
01:02:55.200 --> 01:02:55.400
Yeah.
是啊。

1487
01:02:55.400 --> 01:02:56.800
What do I owe you?
我该付你多少钱？

1488
01:02:56.980 --> 01:02:58.300
She says, 50 cents.
她说，50美分。

1489
01:02:58.540 --> 01:02:58.720
Yeah.
是啊。

1490
01:02:58.900 --> 01:03:00.120
He's wearing his leather jacket.
他穿着皮夹克。

1491
01:03:00.300 --> 01:03:01.100
It's unzipped.
拉链没拉。

1492
01:03:01.360 --> 01:03:02.720
Still no shirt underneath.
里面还是没穿衬衫。

1493
01:03:02.980 --> 01:03:03.460
Amazing.
太绝了。

1494
01:03:03.880 --> 01:03:05.760
And then she realizes who it is.
然后她认出他是谁了。

1495
01:03:05.920 --> 01:03:06.960
It's the cool rider.
是那个帅气车手。

1496
01:03:07.280 --> 01:03:10.740
And they are going to go for this bike ride.
然后他们要去骑摩托车兜风。

1497
01:03:10.920 --> 01:03:13.220
I mean, Stephanie is living her best life.
我是说，斯蒂芬妮正过着她最惬意的生活。

1498
01:03:13.420 --> 01:03:13.720
Yeah.
是啊。

1499
01:03:13.920 --> 01:03:15.380
They ride away on the bike.
他们骑着摩托车走了。

1500
01:03:15.520 --> 01:03:16.760
She's wearing no helmet.
她没戴头盔。

1501
01:03:16.940 --> 01:03:17.520
No helmet.
没有头盔。

1502
01:03:17.700 --> 01:03:20.580
Her hair also looks fine by the end of it.
到最后她的头发看起来也很好。

1503
01:03:20.580 --> 01:03:21.740
She hasn't eaten a bug.
她没有吃虫子。

1504
01:03:21.940 --> 01:03:23.300
Her eyes aren't watery.
她的眼睛没有含泪。

1505
01:03:23.660 --> 01:03:25.200
And her hair looks normal.
而且她的头发看起来很正常。

1506
01:03:25.660 --> 01:03:26.220
You're right.
你说得对。

1507
01:03:27.260 --> 01:03:34.420
Also, though, in the middle of them going down the road, she moves and straddles him from the front.
而且，在他们骑车下路的途中，她移动并从正面跨坐在他身上。

1508
01:03:34.660 --> 01:03:34.860
Yeah.
对。

1509
01:03:34.860 --> 01:03:37.280
She does, like, a little leg wrap around.
她做了一个，类似双腿缠绕的动作。

1510
01:03:37.820 --> 01:03:38.220
Yeah.
对。

1511
01:03:38.480 --> 01:03:38.820
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1512
01:03:39.060 --> 01:03:41.940
They stop at sunset at the top of the hill.
他们在日落时分停在山顶。

1513
01:03:42.140 --> 01:03:42.860
They are kissing.
他们在接吻。

1514
01:03:43.340 --> 01:03:45.780
He's never taken off his helmet or his goggles.
他从头到尾都没摘下过头盔或护目镜。

1515
01:03:45.980 --> 01:03:46.160
Nope.
没错。

1516
01:03:46.280 --> 01:03:47.140
This whole time.
这么长时间。

1517
01:03:47.340 --> 01:03:49.160
Pretty sure his goggles have fogged up.
我敢肯定他的护目镜已经起雾了。

1518
01:03:49.600 --> 01:03:51.900
And he's about to reveal his identity.
而且他正要揭晓自己的身份。

1519
01:03:52.320 --> 01:03:57.440
And then they're interrupted by the arrival of the entire T-Bird gang.
然后他们被突然赶到的整个雷鸟帮打断了。

1520
01:03:57.440 --> 01:03:58.140
Yeah.
对。

1521
01:03:58.400 --> 01:03:59.460
And he races away.
接着他骑车跑了。

1522
01:03:59.580 --> 01:04:01.760
He says, I'll see you Friday night at the talent show.
他说，周五晚上才艺表演上见。

1523
01:04:01.760 --> 01:04:03.060
And she's like, what?
然后她的反应是，什么？

1524
01:04:03.380 --> 01:04:03.920
Talent show?
才艺表演？

1525
01:04:04.080 --> 01:04:04.940
How did he know?
他是怎么知道的？

1526
01:04:05.280 --> 01:04:05.680
Yeah.
对。

1527
01:04:05.920 --> 01:04:06.080
Yeah.
对。

1528
01:04:06.920 --> 01:04:10.180
So this is pretty steamy, this moment between them, right?
所以这一幕，他们之间的这一刻挺火辣的，对吧？

1529
01:04:10.300 --> 01:04:11.580
Like, they have some chemistry.
就像，他们之间有点化学反应。

1530
01:04:11.820 --> 01:04:12.960
Like, you're seeing them together.
就是，你看着他们在一起的样子。

1531
01:04:13.180 --> 01:04:20.020
Would you be surprised to know that, according to the internet, Michelle Pfeiffer and Maxwell Caulfield did not get along during filming?
如果你知道根据网上的说法，米歇尔·菲佛和麦克斯韦·考尔菲德在拍摄期间相处得并不融洽，你会不会感到惊讶？

1532
01:04:20.480 --> 01:04:23.180
Oh, I read that it was platonic.
哦，我看到过报道说他们只是柏拉图式的关系。

1533
01:04:23.400 --> 01:04:25.280
I didn't know it was, um...
我不知道原来是，嗯……

1534
01:04:25.280 --> 01:04:28.060
Yeah, maybe doesn't get along is the wrong wording.
对，也许相处不融洽这个词用得不太对。

1535
01:04:28.240 --> 01:04:34.380
But a few years after the film was released, Maxwell said in an interview that they got along infamously.
但在这部电影上映几年后，麦克斯韦在一次采访中说他们相处得“大名鼎鼎”地糟糕。

1536
01:04:34.820 --> 01:04:39.920
And Michelle Pfeiffer, supposedly in an interview, said that she found Maxwell self-adoring.
而米歇尔·菲佛据称在一次采访中说，她觉得麦克斯韦自我感觉极好。

1537
01:04:41.340 --> 01:04:48.100
So, you know, this just goes to show you, you don't have to have chemistry in real life to have sparks fly on screen.
所以呢，这正好说明，现实生活中不一定非要有化学反应，银幕上也能擦出火花。

1538
01:04:48.600 --> 01:04:49.080
Acting!
这就是演技！

1539
01:04:49.560 --> 01:04:49.900
Acting.
演技啊。

1540
01:04:50.460 --> 01:04:52.860
Well, here's the thing, guys.
好吧，情况是这样的，各位。

1541
01:04:53.400 --> 01:04:56.220
Johnny is super upset by Stephanie's new romance.
约翰尼对斯蒂芬妮的新恋情非常沮丧。

1542
01:04:56.700 --> 01:04:59.440
He threatens to fight the mysterious writer.
他威胁要跟那个神秘作家决斗。

1543
01:05:00.020 --> 01:05:01.860
Stephanie's like, stay out of my life.
斯蒂芬妮的态度是，少管我的闲事。

1544
01:05:02.020 --> 01:05:05.640
Now Paulette is pissed because she's like, Johnny, you don't ever get jealous about me.
现在宝莱气坏了，因为她觉得，约翰尼，你从来不会为我吃醋。

1545
01:05:06.340 --> 01:05:08.280
Everyone tells Sharon to shut up.
大家让莎伦闭嘴。

1546
01:05:08.320 --> 01:05:10.340
So all the ladies leave in a huff.
于是姑娘们都气冲冲地走了。

1547
01:05:10.520 --> 01:05:12.960
They all storm inside the gas station.
她们全都气势汹汹地冲进了加油站。

1548
01:05:13.100 --> 01:05:13.440
That's right.
没错。

1549
01:05:13.440 --> 01:05:14.240
Slam the door.
把门摔上。

1550
01:05:14.240 --> 01:05:16.860
I have a wardrobe tidbit about this scene.
关于这个场景，我有一个服装方面的小八卦。

1551
01:05:17.020 --> 01:05:17.380
Yes.
是的。

1552
01:05:17.620 --> 01:05:20.700
First of all, I did not discuss this up top.
首先，我之前没有在开头讨论过这一点。

1553
01:05:20.700 --> 01:05:21.280
I should have.
我本该说的。

1554
01:05:21.460 --> 01:05:22.840
All the pink ladies have a look.
所有粉红佳人都各有造型。

1555
01:05:23.140 --> 01:05:24.640
Sharon is Jackie Kennedy.
莎伦就是杰奎琳·肯尼迪。

1556
01:05:24.860 --> 01:05:27.640
That's why she wears the little pillbox hat and pearls.
这就是为什么她戴着小药丸帽和珍珠项链。

1557
01:05:28.280 --> 01:05:29.960
Stephanie is usually an all-black.
斯蒂芬妮通常是一身黑。

1558
01:05:30.380 --> 01:05:32.240
You know, she's the motorcycle kind of gal.
你知道的，她是个骑摩托车的酷女孩。

1559
01:05:32.440 --> 01:05:33.400
She's got the necklace.
她戴着项链。

1560
01:05:34.140 --> 01:05:35.940
Allison wears headbands and scarves.
埃里森总是戴着发带和丝巾。

1561
01:05:36.540 --> 01:05:38.980
Paulette's character wants to be Marilyn Monroe.
波莱特的角色想要成为玛丽莲·梦露。

1562
01:05:39.240 --> 01:05:40.320
I mean, that's clear.
我的意思是，这很明显。

1563
01:05:40.860 --> 01:05:41.140
Yes.
是的。

1564
01:05:41.340 --> 01:05:46.680
And in this scene, she is dressed almost identical to Marilyn in the white dress that even flies
在这场戏里，她的打扮几乎和玛丽莲那条白裙子一模一样，甚至在

1565
01:05:46.680 --> 01:05:48.560
up as she walks into the gas station.
她走进加油站时裙摆还会飘起来。

1566
01:05:48.940 --> 01:05:53.620
But here's what actress Lorna Luft had to say about trying to get this Marilyn look.
但演员洛娜·拉夫特谈到如何呈现这个玛丽莲造型时是这么说的。

1567
01:05:53.840 --> 01:06:03.640
The whole thing with me was they wanted this character to sort of be this character who
我遇到的全部问题在于，他们希望这个角色有点像那种

1568
01:06:03.640 --> 01:06:05.800
was obsessed with Marilyn Monroe.
痴迷于玛丽莲·梦露的人。

1569
01:06:06.040 --> 01:06:08.240
So it was all about my hair.
所以一切都取决于我的头发。

1570
01:06:08.240 --> 01:06:15.920
And Alan wanted me to be literally the platinum blonde.
艾伦希望我完完全全变成铂金色金发。

1571
01:06:16.260 --> 01:06:23.620
And he sent me to a hairdresser in Westwood.
他把我送到韦斯特伍德的一家美发店。

1572
01:06:25.280 --> 01:06:28.600
And she bleached out my hair.
她把我的头发漂成了金色。

1573
01:06:28.680 --> 01:06:31.660
And I got to tell you, it was really painful.
我得告诉你，这真的很痛苦。

1574
01:06:32.380 --> 01:06:38.300
And because in those days, they didn't have the real bleach now that they have that isn't
因为在那个年代，他们没有现在这种真正不会感到疼痛的

1575
01:06:38.300 --> 01:06:38.700
painful.
漂发剂。

1576
01:06:38.940 --> 01:06:40.540
They bleached out my hair.
他们把我的头发给漂了。

1577
01:06:40.660 --> 01:06:41.400
I was weeping.
我当时都哭了。

1578
01:06:41.400 --> 01:06:48.740
And the next day, I went in to hair and makeup for a hair and makeup test for the film.
第二天，我去发型和化妆间参加电影的发型和化妆测试。

1579
01:06:48.920 --> 01:06:53.260
And the hairdresser went like this, and it came out in her hand.
结果发型师手这么一抓，头发就掉在她手里了。

1580
01:06:54.680 --> 01:06:56.960
They had broken off all my hair.
他们把我的头发全弄断了。

1581
01:06:57.760 --> 01:07:00.180
My hair was this long.
我的头发原来只有这么长。

1582
01:07:00.420 --> 01:07:02.980
And that's when Alan said, oh, put a wig on her.
也就是在那时，艾伦说，哦，给她戴个假发吧。

1583
01:07:04.340 --> 01:07:08.340
I thought to myself, they couldn't have thought about that before they did that to me.
我心里想，他们在对我做这种事之前怎么就没想到这一点呢。

1584
01:07:09.000 --> 01:07:11.420
So Alan that she's talking to is Alan Carr.
所以她提到的这个艾伦是艾伦·卡尔。

1585
01:07:11.580 --> 01:07:13.420
He was a producer on the movie.
他是这部电影的制片人。

1586
01:07:14.020 --> 01:07:18.820
And when you watch the interview, she sort of does the motion of what the hair person did.
当你观看这段采访时，她模仿了当时发型师的动作。

1587
01:07:18.960 --> 01:07:19.240
Yeah.
对。

1588
01:07:19.400 --> 01:07:21.220
Was just run her fingers through her hair.
就是用手指从头发里穿过去。

1589
01:07:21.460 --> 01:07:23.300
And it just came out in clumps.
然后头发就一团一团地脱落了。

1590
01:07:23.300 --> 01:07:31.240
I mean, that's because, like she said, it was like they just like scalded your hair back then.
我的意思是，这是因为就像她说的，那会儿弄头发简直就像把头发烫伤了一样。

1591
01:07:31.380 --> 01:07:35.580
She said her hair ended up being like about an inch in length.
她说她的头发最后只剩下大约一英寸长。

1592
01:07:35.620 --> 01:07:37.180
It broke off that much.
断得只剩那么多。

1593
01:07:37.340 --> 01:07:37.720
Wow.
哇。

1594
01:07:38.020 --> 01:07:38.260
Yeah.
是啊。

1595
01:07:39.020 --> 01:07:39.440
Oh.
哦。

1596
01:07:39.560 --> 01:07:43.780
So shout out to Lorna Luft for enduring all that.
所以要向忍受了这一切的洛娜·拉夫特致敬。

1597
01:07:44.500 --> 01:07:45.920
She's so good in the movie.
她在电影里表现得太棒了。

1598
01:07:46.060 --> 01:07:46.780
She's so great.
她真的太棒了。

1599
01:07:46.780 --> 01:07:48.200
I love her as Paulette.
我太喜欢她演的波莱特了。

1600
01:07:48.220 --> 01:07:48.760
I do too.
我也是。

1601
01:07:48.760 --> 01:07:56.980
Well, with all the girls inside the gas station, the T-Birds, they decide that they need some guaranteed action.
嗯，由于所有的女生都在加油站里面，雷鸟帮觉得他们需要找点刺激。

1602
01:07:57.200 --> 01:07:57.320
Yeah.
对。

1603
01:07:57.380 --> 01:07:58.440
They're going to go prowling.
他们打算去四处闲逛。

1604
01:07:58.720 --> 01:07:59.080
Yeah.
对。

1605
01:07:59.320 --> 01:08:07.140
They launch into the going prowling song, which kind of turns into a rehearsal for their talent show performance.
他们唱起了四处闲逛之歌，这有点像为他们的才艺秀表演进行排练。

1606
01:08:07.480 --> 01:08:07.600
Yeah.
对。

1607
01:08:07.660 --> 01:08:09.460
It like morphs into it.
感觉就像是演变过去的。

1608
01:08:09.980 --> 01:08:17.380
And I will say the number they perform, I guess, for the talent show stylistically is really cool looking.
而且我要说的是，我猜他们在才艺秀上表演的那个节目，在风格上看起来真的很酷。

1609
01:08:17.380 --> 01:08:21.380
There's like this back thin curtain on the stage.
舞台后面好像有一层薄薄的幕布。

1610
01:08:21.520 --> 01:08:21.760
Yeah.
对。

1611
01:08:21.920 --> 01:08:24.820
And the gals, I guess where you go to score is the grocery store.
至于那些姑娘们，我猜你们去约会的地方就是杂货店。

1612
01:08:25.020 --> 01:08:25.300
Yeah.
对。

1613
01:08:25.440 --> 01:08:32.260
Because it's like three ladies' shadows and they're cashiers at a grocery store and they're dancing.
因为那好像是三个女性的剪影，她们是杂货店的收银员，而且她们在跳舞。

1614
01:08:32.500 --> 01:08:32.600
Yeah.
对。

1615
01:08:32.680 --> 01:08:35.700
It's this cool kind of black and white effect behind them.
她们身后有一种很酷的黑白效果。

1616
01:08:35.880 --> 01:08:36.140
Yeah.
对。

1617
01:08:36.500 --> 01:08:38.500
And now we know their talent show number.
现在我们知道了他们的才艺秀节目。

1618
01:08:38.980 --> 01:08:39.460
Right.
没错。

1619
01:08:40.460 --> 01:08:41.120
All right.
好吧。

1620
01:08:41.120 --> 01:08:43.660
Well, now we're back in Miss Mason's class.
好了，现在我们回到了梅森老师的课堂。

1621
01:08:44.020 --> 01:08:45.860
She's now teaching English.
她现在在上英语课。

1622
01:08:46.680 --> 01:08:52.060
And Stephanie has to stay after class because she didn't do well on her Shakespeare essay.
斯蒂芬妮必须留堂，因为她的莎士比亚论文写得不好。

1623
01:08:52.440 --> 01:08:52.740
Right.
没错。

1624
01:08:53.240 --> 01:08:54.800
Guess who's going to help her, you guys?
大家猜猜谁要帮她？

1625
01:08:54.800 --> 01:08:55.760
It's Michael.
是迈克尔。

1626
01:08:56.200 --> 01:08:56.460
Yeah.
对。

1627
01:08:56.700 --> 01:09:02.560
They have a very cute scene at like this little coffee shop where he's going to help her with her homework.
他们在一家小咖啡馆里有一场非常可爱的戏，他要在那里帮她做作业。

1628
01:09:02.700 --> 01:09:05.800
And there's chemistry there where he's just Michael.
而且他们之间有种默契，那就是本色的迈克尔。

1629
01:09:06.560 --> 01:09:07.820
There is chemistry.
确实有默契。

1630
01:09:07.820 --> 01:09:14.840
Yes, this scene is meant to show that Michael and Stephanie can have a connection even when he's not the cool writer.
是的，这场戏旨在表明，即使迈克尔不是那个酷炫的作家，他和斯蒂芬妮也能产生联系。

1631
01:09:15.180 --> 01:09:15.460
Right.
没错。

1632
01:09:15.700 --> 01:09:17.160
But here's my beef with it.
但这就是我对它的不满之处。

1633
01:09:17.520 --> 01:09:26.080
I don't understand how after spending a significant amount of time with Stephanie, Michael isn't totally turned off by her.
我无法理解，在和斯蒂芬妮花了大量时间在一起之后，迈克尔怎么会完全没有被她恶心到。

1634
01:09:26.340 --> 01:09:29.120
She seems completely superficial and self-absorbed.
她看起来完全浮夸又自我中心。

1635
01:09:29.240 --> 01:09:32.020
She just keeps talking to him about the cool writer.
她一直跟他谈论那个酷炫的作家。

1636
01:09:32.280 --> 01:09:35.940
She says, what if he takes off his goggles and he's just like an ordinary guy?
她说，如果他摘下护目镜，发现他只是个普通人怎么办？

1637
01:09:35.960 --> 01:09:37.660
And he's like, what if he is?
然后他说，如果他是呢？

1638
01:09:37.820 --> 01:09:39.900
And then she's like, I don't want to talk about this anymore.
接着她说，我不想再谈这个了。

1639
01:09:40.160 --> 01:09:42.860
And then like she's obsessed with the ketchup.
然后她好像对番茄酱着迷了。

1640
01:09:43.640 --> 01:09:48.480
And like everything about her is like a giant turnoff to me.
关于她的一切对我来说都是巨大的劝退点。

1641
01:09:48.620 --> 01:09:50.940
And she kind of eats a hamburger like the Carl's Jr.
而且她吃汉堡的样子有点像卡乐星的广告。

1642
01:09:51.340 --> 01:09:51.640
commercial.
广告。

1643
01:09:51.960 --> 01:09:53.500
I love how she eats the hamburger.
我喜欢她吃汉堡的方式。

1644
01:09:53.840 --> 01:09:54.480
It's so gross.
太恶心了。

1645
01:09:54.520 --> 01:09:57.480
No, I like it because she's not being fussy about it.
不，我喜欢是因为她对此一点都不讲究。

1646
01:09:57.560 --> 01:09:59.800
She's going to dive right into that burger and the fries.
她要一头扎进那个汉堡和薯条里。

1647
01:09:59.800 --> 01:10:02.080
But I don't know.
但我不知道。

1648
01:10:02.220 --> 01:10:04.680
I mean, he's just like an intelligent person.
我的意思是，他明明是个聪明人。

1649
01:10:05.180 --> 01:10:10.760
And I feel like he's dumbing himself down for her, which always bums me out when people do in movies.
我觉得他在为了她而降低自己的智商，每当电影里有人这么做时，我总是感到很扫兴。

1650
01:10:11.160 --> 01:10:11.980
I don't know.
我不知道。

1651
01:10:12.200 --> 01:10:20.300
I think my thing with him is that he has to figure out how to be something he's not to win her over.
我觉得我和他最大的不同在于，他为了赢得她的芳心，不得不去假装成一个连他自己都不是的人。

1652
01:10:20.520 --> 01:10:21.000
Yes.
没错。

1653
01:10:21.000 --> 01:10:22.340
And that's what you don't want to do.
而这正是你不想去做的。

1654
01:10:22.480 --> 01:10:23.840
You want to be your authentic self.
你想做回最真实的自己。

1655
01:10:24.020 --> 01:10:24.320
Right.
对。

1656
01:10:24.420 --> 01:10:26.460
And have someone love you just as you are.
让别人爱上原本的你。

1657
01:10:26.660 --> 01:10:28.920
Well, she is impressed by him.
不过，她对他印象挺深刻的。

1658
01:10:29.280 --> 01:10:30.460
By his smarts.
被他的聪明才智吸引。

1659
01:10:30.600 --> 01:10:30.960
Yes.
是的。

1660
01:10:31.820 --> 01:10:33.100
But then he downplays it.
但他却把这归结得很平淡。

1661
01:10:33.260 --> 01:10:35.120
He's like, oh, I'm no smarter than you.
他就好像在说，哦，我可不比你聪明。

1662
01:10:35.200 --> 01:10:37.400
I don't understand this stuff any more than you do.
这些东西我懂的并不比你多。

1663
01:10:37.420 --> 01:10:39.880
I just know a few big words that impress teachers.
我只是知道几个能糊弄老师的大词儿罢了。

1664
01:10:40.040 --> 01:10:41.760
It's like, no, Michael, I think you understand it.
这就好比，不对，迈克尔，我觉得你是懂的。

1665
01:10:41.900 --> 01:10:43.800
I think you actually understand Hamlet.
我觉得你其实是懂《哈姆雷特》的。

1666
01:10:43.800 --> 01:10:44.720
I think you do.
我觉得你真的懂。

1667
01:10:45.380 --> 01:10:47.640
Well, he's going to ask her out again.
好吧，他打算再次约她出去。

1668
01:10:47.760 --> 01:10:50.580
And she's like, no, you know, pink lady code, blah, blah, blah.
然后她的反应是，不行，你知道的，粉红女郎法典，巴拉巴拉什么的。

1669
01:10:50.780 --> 01:10:53.580
And he's like, according to Dolores, the code stinks.
然后他的反应是，根据多洛莉斯的说法，这法典烂透了。

1670
01:10:54.200 --> 01:10:54.360
Yeah.
是啊。

1671
01:10:54.980 --> 01:10:56.240
Johnny and Goose show up.
强尼和古斯出现了。

1672
01:10:56.860 --> 01:10:59.340
Johnny sees Michael talking to Stephanie.
强尼看到迈克尔在和斯蒂芬妮说话。

1673
01:10:59.640 --> 01:11:01.460
Once again, he's super ticked off.
毫不意外，他又超级火大。

1674
01:11:01.660 --> 01:11:05.960
And lady, I think maybe Michael Scott had watched Grease 2.
而且女士们，我觉得迈克尔·斯科特可能看过《油脂2》。

1675
01:11:06.340 --> 01:11:06.780
Why?
为什么？

1676
01:11:06.980 --> 01:11:08.400
I think you got to hear this.
我觉得你得听听这个。

1677
01:11:08.900 --> 01:11:10.080
What do you want, Johnny?
你想干嘛，强尼？

1678
01:11:11.120 --> 01:11:13.700
Yeah, well, I just wanted to let you know
是啊，我只是想告诉你

1679
01:11:13.700 --> 01:11:17.420
that I'm officially declaring us as an item officially over.
我们俩的关系从现在起正式彻底结束了。

1680
01:11:19.040 --> 01:11:19.820
You're declaring.
你在单方面宣布。

1681
01:11:20.200 --> 01:11:20.920
That's correct.
没错。

1682
01:11:22.930 --> 01:11:23.570
Okay, fine.
好吧，行。

1683
01:11:23.730 --> 01:11:23.990
Okay?
好吗？

1684
01:11:24.270 --> 01:11:24.990
You declared it.
你宣布了。

1685
01:11:25.150 --> 01:11:25.750
It's over.
结束了。

1686
01:11:26.210 --> 01:11:27.090
Can I go now?
我现在可以走了吗？

1687
01:11:28.150 --> 01:11:29.070
He declared it.
他居然宣布了。

1688
01:11:29.290 --> 01:11:30.750
I declare bankruptcy.
我宣布破产。

1689
01:11:31.390 --> 01:11:33.250
That's all I could think about in that scene.
我在那场戏里满脑子想的都是这个。

1690
01:11:33.770 --> 01:11:35.750
Well, he asked her for her pink lady's jacket.
好吧，他管她要她的粉红女郎夹克。

1691
01:11:36.010 --> 01:11:36.270
Yeah.
对。

1692
01:11:36.350 --> 01:11:37.610
He's like, I have a rep to protect.
他好像在说，我还要维护名声呢。

1693
01:11:38.070 --> 01:11:40.490
If you're not going to date me, you're out of the pink ladies.
如果你不跟我约会，你就别想再待在粉红女郎里了。

1694
01:11:40.750 --> 01:11:44.550
If you're not going to date me while I date you and Paulette, you're out.
如果你既不肯跟我约会，还让我脚踩两条船和保莱特约会，你就被开除了。

1695
01:11:45.190 --> 01:11:47.750
Well, she doesn't give him his jacket.
好吧，她没把夹克给他。

1696
01:11:48.010 --> 01:11:49.730
And do you see where she goes?
而且你看到她去哪儿了吗？

1697
01:11:49.990 --> 01:11:51.730
Do you see where she walks to?
你看到她走到哪儿了吗？

1698
01:11:52.630 --> 01:11:54.270
The pink lady car.
粉红女郎的车。

1699
01:11:54.630 --> 01:11:56.030
Whose car is it?
那是谁的车？

1700
01:11:56.210 --> 01:11:57.910
Now she's driving it.
现在她正在开着呢。

1701
01:11:58.030 --> 01:11:58.370
I know.
我知道。

1702
01:11:58.430 --> 01:11:59.810
Now she's getting in the car.
现在她上车了。

1703
01:11:59.970 --> 01:12:00.930
I don't get it.
我不懂。

1704
01:12:01.090 --> 01:12:07.310
It cuts to Michael, who's standing watching all of this by his motorcycle.
镜头切到迈克尔，他正站在他的摩托车旁看着这一切。

1705
01:12:07.970 --> 01:12:10.330
By the cool rider's motorcycle.
站在那个酷炫骑手的摩托车旁。

1706
01:12:11.150 --> 01:12:16.770
No one notices that he's standing next to the motorcycle with the red flames on it?
竟然没人注意到他就站在那辆有红色火焰图案的摩托车旁边？

1707
01:12:16.910 --> 01:12:19.650
What is with the vehicles in this film?
这电影里的交通工具是怎么回事？

1708
01:12:19.790 --> 01:12:20.270
Anyway.
总之。

1709
01:12:20.790 --> 01:12:21.630
Oh, God.
噢，天哪。

1710
01:12:21.750 --> 01:12:24.330
Now the part of the movie that I fast forward through.
现在到了我快进的电影片段。

1711
01:12:24.710 --> 01:12:26.250
It's the super long.
超级长的一段。

1712
01:12:26.450 --> 01:12:27.390
It's the only part.
这是唯一的一段。

1713
01:12:27.530 --> 01:12:29.170
It's the only part I don't watch.
这是我唯一不看的部分。

1714
01:12:29.190 --> 01:12:31.090
Let me tell you why you shouldn't fast forward.
让我告诉你为什么你不应该快进。

1715
01:12:31.350 --> 01:12:31.750
Why?
为什么？

1716
01:12:31.750 --> 01:12:36.230
There is no one hotter in a turquoise sweater than Maxwell Caulfield.
麦克斯韦·考尔菲德穿着松石绿毛衣的样子简直性感得无以复加。

1717
01:12:37.270 --> 01:12:39.430
He is so dreamy in this sweater.
他穿这件毛衣简直太迷人了。

1718
01:12:39.650 --> 01:12:42.270
I swear to God, they're selling it right now at Marine Layer.
我发誓，他们现在在Marine Layer就能买到同款。

1719
01:12:42.530 --> 01:12:44.010
It's like a timeless sweater.
这就像是一件永不过时的毛衣。

1720
01:12:44.270 --> 01:12:45.310
He looks so cute.
他看起来太可爱了。

1721
01:12:45.550 --> 01:12:48.090
The song is long and boring.
这首歌又长又无聊。

1722
01:12:48.090 --> 01:12:49.310
It's called My Charade.
歌名叫《我的伪装》。

1723
01:12:49.410 --> 01:12:49.610
Yeah.
对。

1724
01:12:50.030 --> 01:12:51.730
It's him in the cafeteria.
这是他在自助餐厅的场景。

1725
01:12:51.730 --> 01:12:56.110
It's all different moments in high school where he's just tired of playing the charade.
全都是高中里不同的时刻，他只是厌倦了这种虚伪的游戏。

1726
01:12:56.350 --> 01:12:56.650
Yeah.
对。

1727
01:12:56.650 --> 01:12:58.490
Half the time, he's not singing.
有一半的时间，他根本没在唱歌。

1728
01:12:58.490 --> 01:13:00.470
He's just walking and looking around.
他只是在走来走去，四处张望。

1729
01:13:00.710 --> 01:13:01.270
I know.
我知道。

1730
01:13:01.370 --> 01:13:02.870
And the song is like a voiceover.
而且这首歌就像是画外音。

1731
01:13:03.090 --> 01:13:03.510
Yes.
没错。

1732
01:13:03.510 --> 01:13:04.430
It's all odd.
一切都很古怪。

1733
01:13:04.730 --> 01:13:05.210
Yes.
是的。

1734
01:13:05.510 --> 01:13:08.150
But now it's the night of the talent show.
但现在是才艺表演之夜了。

1735
01:13:09.010 --> 01:13:11.670
Stephanie's waiting out front in her sparkly jacket.
斯蒂芬妮穿着闪亮的夹克在门外等着。

1736
01:13:12.290 --> 01:13:13.650
Cool Rider shows up.
酷炫骑手出现了。

1737
01:13:13.950 --> 01:13:14.290
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1738
01:13:14.530 --> 01:13:16.510
But uh-oh, the T-Birds show up too.
但是，哦噢，雷鸟帮也出现了。

1739
01:13:16.510 --> 01:13:17.690
So he rides away.
于是他骑车跑了。

1740
01:13:18.190 --> 01:13:18.710
Why?
为什么？

1741
01:13:18.910 --> 01:13:21.230
Why does he keep riding away from the T-Birds?
他为什么总是躲着雷鸟帮？

1742
01:13:21.330 --> 01:13:25.730
He took on 20 of the cycle lords outside the bowling alley.
他在保龄球馆外单挑过二十个飞车党。

1743
01:13:25.730 --> 01:13:26.890
This is four people.
这里才四个人。

1744
01:13:27.050 --> 01:13:30.450
But apparently, he can't take on these four guys on the motorcycle.
但显然，他对付不了骑摩托车的这四个家伙。

1745
01:13:30.450 --> 01:13:35.830
So he speeds away, and the T-Birds chase him, and then the girls follow them in the pink car.
所以他加速逃跑，雷鸟帮在后面追他，然后女生们开着粉色轿车跟在后面。

1746
01:13:36.030 --> 01:13:36.970
And guess what?
你猜怎么着？

1747
01:13:37.050 --> 01:13:38.350
There's a construction site.
那里有个建筑工地。

1748
01:13:38.350 --> 01:13:44.030
It conceals the deadly drop of Dead Man's Curve, and he just goes flying off into the night.
它掩盖了绝命弯那致命的断崖，而他直接飞进了夜色中。

1749
01:13:44.510 --> 01:13:45.910
Can I say what I wrote?
我能念念我写的内容吗？

1750
01:13:46.410 --> 01:13:46.810
Yeah.
行。

1751
01:13:47.190 --> 01:13:47.690
He died?
他死了？

1752
01:13:48.530 --> 01:13:50.590
I thought, where does the movie go from here?
我在想，电影接下来要怎么演？

1753
01:13:50.770 --> 01:13:52.170
You really thought he died?
你真的以为他死了？

1754
01:13:52.690 --> 01:13:54.330
How do you come back from that?
那怎么圆得回来？

1755
01:13:55.050 --> 01:13:57.190
I thought he might have died.
我以为他可能真的死了。

1756
01:13:57.970 --> 01:13:58.850
Well, that's good.
嗯，那挺好的。

1757
01:13:58.970 --> 01:14:00.250
That's what they wanted you to think.
那就是他们想让你以为的。

1758
