你是唯一能让我们的爱延续下去的人。

1926
01:19:55.970 --> 01:19:58.350
So, Stephanie, don't forget me.
所以，斯蒂芬妮，别忘了我。

1927
01:19:58.790 --> 01:19:59.650
I promise.
我保证。

1928
01:20:03.050 --> 01:20:04.130
I love you.
我爱你。

1929
01:20:21.480 --> 01:20:25.800
Yeah, so then it morphs back into her being in the talent show.
对，然后画面又变回了她在才艺秀现场。

1930
01:20:25.800 --> 01:20:31.200
Yes, and she's singing this weird solo now that has nothing to do with Calendar Girls.
是的，她现在唱着这首奇怪的独唱，跟《日历女孩》一点关系也没有。

1931
01:20:31.320 --> 01:20:32.600
She's singing,
她在唱，

1932
01:20:33.220 --> 01:20:34.260
Turn back.
回去吧。

1933
01:20:34.640 --> 01:20:35.040
Uh-oh.
噢噢。

1934
01:20:35.260 --> 01:20:35.600
Turn back.
回去吧。

1935
01:20:35.600 --> 01:20:36.140
All by herself.
就她一个人。

1936
01:20:36.700 --> 01:20:39.200
The crowd is mesmerized.
人群都看呆了。

1937
01:20:39.300 --> 01:20:39.520
Yes.
是的。

1938
01:20:39.620 --> 01:20:41.000
You could hear a pin drop.
全场鸦雀无声。

1939
01:20:41.240 --> 01:20:42.100
She's sad.
她很伤心。

1940
01:20:42.280 --> 01:20:43.600
She's on her knees.
她跪倒在地。

1941
01:20:43.960 --> 01:20:45.040
The song ends.
歌曲结束了。

1942
01:20:45.040 --> 01:20:48.400
And the audience erupts into a standing ovation.
观众们起立，爆发出一阵热烈的掌声。

1943
01:20:48.620 --> 01:20:48.820
Ovation.
掌声。

1944
01:20:49.500 --> 01:20:52.180
And then Johnny and Stephanie win the talent show.
然后强尼和斯蒂芬妮赢得了才艺秀。

1945
01:20:52.400 --> 01:20:58.360
They win the talent show, which I didn't realize meant that they were crowned king and queen of a luau.
他们赢得了才艺秀，而我之前没意识到这意味着他们会被加冕为夏威夷烤肉晚会的国王和王后。

1946
01:20:58.840 --> 01:21:00.220
Which is coming up.
接下来就是这个。

1947
01:21:00.540 --> 01:21:03.280
It's all high-road at this point.
到这里一切都走上了正轨。

1948
01:21:03.580 --> 01:21:04.700
What is happening?
这到底是怎么回事？

1949
01:21:06.200 --> 01:21:07.200
What is happening?
这到底是怎么回事？

1950
01:21:07.680 --> 01:21:07.740
What is happening?
这到底是怎么回事？

1951
01:21:07.740 --> 01:21:09.720
Now we have a rock-a-hula luau.
现在我们有了摇滚草裙舞派对。

1952
01:21:10.000 --> 01:21:13.340
Yes, this is clearly the we-go-together of Greece, too.
对，这显然也是希腊版的“我们心相连”。

1953
01:21:13.600 --> 01:21:15.180
This is—you know what this number is?
这是——你知道这段是什么吗？

1954
01:21:15.300 --> 01:21:16.840
We don't know where the script is going.
我们不知道剧本会走向何方。

1955
01:21:17.020 --> 01:21:19.120
Let's get everyone back in one big scene together.
让我们把所有人重新聚在一个大场景里。

1956
01:21:19.560 --> 01:21:20.520
Dance it out!
跳起来吧！

1957
01:21:20.860 --> 01:21:25.260
I wrote—there are so many continuity errors in this luau scene, I don't even know how to start.
我写了——这个草裙舞场景里的连贯性错误太多了，我都不知道该从何说起。

1958
01:21:25.260 --> 01:21:30.620
Well, I want to talk about how everybody is dressed so festively except for Stephanie,
嗯，我想聊聊为什么每个人都穿着节日盛装，除了斯蒂芬妮，

1959
01:21:30.620 --> 01:21:32.780
who's still mourning the death of Cool Rider.
她还在为酷骑手的死而悲伤。

1960
01:21:33.000 --> 01:21:35.680
She shows up in a slouchy gray sweatshirt and jeans.
她穿着一件宽松的灰色运动衫和牛仔裤出现。

1961
01:21:35.840 --> 01:21:36.680
She's over it.
她受够了。

1962
01:21:36.760 --> 01:21:37.440
She's not happy.
她很不高兴。

1963
01:21:37.560 --> 01:21:38.080
She's done.
她受够这一切了。

1964
01:21:38.320 --> 01:21:40.500
But yeah, there's a big dance number.
但是，对，有一场盛大的歌舞表演。

1965
01:21:40.680 --> 01:21:41.580
Big, big dance number.
非常非常盛大的歌舞表演。

1966
01:21:41.800 --> 01:21:46.320
And then there's a big, like, above-ground swimming pool in the middle of this luau.
然后在这个草裙舞派对的中央，居然有一个很大的、地上游泳池。

1967
01:21:46.540 --> 01:21:48.700
My Aunt Louise and Uncle Sunny had one.
我路易丝阿姨和桑尼叔叔家就有一个。

1968
01:21:48.840 --> 01:21:52.920
I don't know how they put so many things in it.
我不知道他们怎么能在里面塞进那么多东西。

1969
01:21:52.920 --> 01:21:56.580
Well, it starts with Mr. Stewart and Miss Mason.
好吧，从斯图尔特先生和梅森小姐开始。

1970
01:21:56.720 --> 01:21:58.360
They're in a boat in the middle.
他们坐在正中央的一艘船里。

1971
01:21:58.600 --> 01:22:03.040
People are swimming and dancing in the water, but then suddenly they're not in the water.
人们在水里游泳和跳舞，但突然间他们就不在水里了。

1972
01:22:03.200 --> 01:22:04.300
And you never see them again.
而且你再也没见过他们。

1973
01:22:04.440 --> 01:22:05.400
In the water, out of the water.
在水里，出水了。

1974
01:22:05.960 --> 01:22:06.940
No one's drying off.
没有人擦干身子。

1975
01:22:07.020 --> 01:22:07.740
There's no towels.
一条毛巾也没有。

1976
01:22:08.060 --> 01:22:08.420
Yes.
没错。

1977
01:22:08.600 --> 01:22:13.940
We dance until the sun sets, and now it's time for the king and queen to take their positions.
我们跳舞直到太阳下山，现在是国王和王后就位的时候了。

1978
01:22:14.460 --> 01:22:16.780
They're in some kind of native dress.
他们穿着某种民族服饰。

1979
01:22:17.020 --> 01:22:18.020
Doesn't feel appropriate.
感觉不太合适。

1980
01:22:18.400 --> 01:22:18.780
Yeah.
对。

1981
01:22:19.400 --> 01:22:20.520
They have crowns.
他们戴着王冠。

1982
01:22:20.640 --> 01:22:22.540
They're in a bamboo raft.
他们在竹筏上。

1983
01:22:22.920 --> 01:22:24.260
With paddles.
拿着桨。

1984
01:22:24.640 --> 01:22:24.800
Yes.
对。

1985
01:22:24.800 --> 01:22:26.600
And they're put in the above-ground pool.
然后他们被放进地上游泳池里。

1986
01:22:27.860 --> 01:22:34.220
By, by, like, six high school guys who are dressed in loincloths.
由，由大约六个穿着遮羞布的高中男生放进去的。

1987
01:22:34.380 --> 01:22:34.480
Yeah.
对。

1988
01:22:34.740 --> 01:22:37.120
Did you see the guy on the right?
你看到右边那个家伙了吗？

1989
01:22:37.980 --> 01:22:39.920
Is it the same guy that ran track?
是那个跑田径的家伙吗？

1990
01:22:40.140 --> 01:22:41.100
I don't know.
我不知道。

1991
01:22:41.380 --> 01:22:45.960
I hope not, because clearly they didn't heat this water.
但愿不是，因为显然他们没有给这水加热。

1992
01:22:45.960 --> 01:22:51.520
Because when this guy hits the water, he visibly, like, flinches.
因为当这家伙掉进水里时，他明显地，缩了一下。

1993
01:22:51.860 --> 01:22:52.000
Oh, no.
哦，不。

1994
01:22:52.000 --> 01:22:54.520
Like, you see, like, the wind come out of him.
就像，你能看到，他的气都喘不匀了。

1995
01:22:54.600 --> 01:22:56.020
He's like, oh, it's so cold.
他好像在说，哦，太冷了。

1996
01:22:56.020 --> 01:22:57.080
It's so cold.
太冷了。

1997
01:22:57.840 --> 01:22:59.100
Johnny is smoking.
强尼在抽烟。

1998
01:22:59.380 --> 01:23:00.520
He's always smoking.
他一直在抽烟。

1999
01:23:00.780 --> 01:23:02.020
He drops his cigarette.
他把烟头掉了。

2000
01:23:02.020 --> 01:23:04.080
He almost catches the raft on fire.
他差点把木筏点着了。

2001
01:23:04.200 --> 01:23:04.380
Yeah.
是啊。

2002
01:23:04.520 --> 01:23:05.360
The bamboo raft.
那个竹筏。

2003
01:23:05.580 --> 01:23:07.240
He and Stephanie are bickering.
他和斯蒂芬妮在吵嘴。

2004
01:23:07.240 --> 01:23:08.880
She's in such a sour mood.
她的心情真是糟透了。

2005
01:23:09.300 --> 01:23:11.120
And now, wouldn't you know it?
结果呢，你猜怎么着？

2006
01:23:12.280 --> 01:23:13.220
Wouldn't you know it?
你猜怎么着？

2007
01:23:13.560 --> 01:23:15.160
The cycle lord, show up.
机车党，出现了。

2008
01:23:15.520 --> 01:23:17.740
Can we—there's one thing I've been wanting to say.
我们能——我一直有一句话想说。

2009
01:23:17.840 --> 01:23:18.480
What is it?
什么话？

2010
01:23:18.580 --> 01:23:19.220
One thing.
就一句。

2011
01:23:19.440 --> 01:23:20.240
There's one thing.
就一句话。

2012
01:23:20.540 --> 01:23:21.300
What is it?
什么话？

2013
01:23:21.300 --> 01:23:22.960
Just go with me on this.
你先顺着我的思路想。

2014
01:23:23.940 --> 01:23:25.940
Let's say you're madly in love with a guy.
比方说你疯狂爱上了一个男人。

2015
01:23:26.160 --> 01:23:26.600
Okay.
好吧。

2016
01:23:26.920 --> 01:23:31.360
Who plummets to his death off a, like, a cliff on a motorcycle.
结果他骑着摩托车从悬崖之类的险境坠落身亡。

2017
01:23:31.660 --> 01:23:31.840
Yeah.
是啊。

2018
01:23:32.020 --> 01:23:33.940
And then you immediately go to your talent show.
然后你马上就去参加你的才艺秀。

2019
01:23:34.140 --> 01:23:34.420
Yeah.
是啊。

2020
01:23:34.620 --> 01:23:35.000
What?
什么？

2021
01:23:36.120 --> 01:23:37.960
That's why she couldn't get through the number, Anne.
这就是她为什么表演不下去的原因，安妮。

2022
01:23:37.980 --> 01:23:39.200
Why did she even go?
她为什么还要去？

2023
01:23:39.440 --> 01:23:40.100
I don't know.
我不知道。

2024
01:23:40.580 --> 01:23:44.860
And now she's, like, on a pontoon boat in an above-ground—
然后她现在居然在地上游泳池里的一个浮桥船上——

2025
01:23:44.860 --> 01:23:46.400
That's why she's so grumpy.
这就是她为什么这么暴躁。

2026
01:23:46.440 --> 01:23:46.880
Okay.
好吧。

2027
01:23:47.160 --> 01:23:48.800
That's why she's so annoyed.
这就是她为什么这么恼火。

2028
01:23:48.980 --> 01:23:49.280
Okay.
好吧。

2029
01:23:50.680 --> 01:23:52.920
Anyway, cycle lords show up.
总之，机车党出现了。

2030
01:23:53.060 --> 01:23:53.300
Yes.
没错。

2031
01:23:53.400 --> 01:23:55.940
And they're running over all the decorations.
而且他们把所有的装饰品都碾碎了。

2032
01:23:56.320 --> 01:23:56.560
It's crazy.
太疯狂了。

2033
01:23:56.980 --> 01:24:00.620
People—there's, like, a cake booth, and they're going to throw cakes at the cycle lords,
人们——有个卖蛋糕的摊位，他们本打算用蛋糕砸机车党，

2034
01:24:00.680 --> 01:24:02.120
but they end up throwing cakes at each other.
但结果他们互相砸起了蛋糕。

2035
01:24:02.260 --> 01:24:02.460
Yeah.
是啊。

2036
01:24:02.840 --> 01:24:04.880
People are throwing stuffed animals at them.
人们开始朝他们扔毛绒玩具。

2037
01:24:05.260 --> 01:24:10.260
Stephanie and Johnny, they're trying to row the raft out of the pool, but they can't seem to row.
斯蒂芬妮和强尼，他们正试图把竹筏划出水池，但他们好像划不动。

2038
01:24:10.480 --> 01:24:11.100
It's not working.
根本不管用。

2039
01:24:11.480 --> 01:24:12.200
Don't worry.
别担心。

2040
01:24:12.420 --> 01:24:13.100
Don't worry.
别担心。

2041
01:24:13.200 --> 01:24:17.980
Because during the mayhem, the mysterious writer shows up.
因为就在一片混乱中，那个神秘的作家登场了。

2042
01:24:18.040 --> 01:24:18.840
He shows up.
他登场了。

2043
01:24:18.840 --> 01:24:21.180
He is on top of a thatched roof.
他在一个茅草屋顶上。

2044
01:24:21.360 --> 01:24:22.380
Very high.
非常高。

2045
01:24:22.620 --> 01:24:22.860
Yeah.
是啊。

2046
01:24:23.020 --> 01:24:23.560
Very high.
非常高。

2047
01:24:23.760 --> 01:24:30.300
He jumps off of it, legs split, and lands on what we guess is his motorcycle,
他从上面跳了下来，双腿劈开，落在了我们猜想是他的摩托车上，

2048
01:24:30.300 --> 01:24:32.400
because the next shot is him just riding away.
因为下一个镜头就是他骑着车扬长而去。

2049
01:24:32.560 --> 01:24:34.860
How his nuts survived that, I don't know.
他的蛋蛋是怎么经受住那一摔的，我可不知道。

2050
01:24:34.980 --> 01:24:35.620
I don't know.
我不知道。

2051
01:24:36.160 --> 01:24:37.940
Here's how he's going to save the day.
这就是他将如何拯救世界的方式。

2052
01:24:38.440 --> 01:24:41.120
He jumps over the pool of water.
他跃过了水池。

2053
01:24:41.260 --> 01:24:42.280
Jumps over Stephanie.
从斯蒂芬妮头上跳过去。

2054
01:24:42.760 --> 01:24:43.100
Yeah.
是啊。

2055
01:24:43.200 --> 01:24:43.780
And Johnny.
还有强尼。

2056
01:24:44.340 --> 01:24:46.080
He makes it all the way across.
他一路成功跳了过去。

2057
01:24:46.640 --> 01:24:51.040
So that means that all the cycle lords have to do the same jump.
所以这意味着所有的飞车领主都必须完成同样的跳跃。

2058
01:24:51.160 --> 01:24:53.660
But they can't do it, and they all land in the water.
但他们做不到，结果全都掉进了水里。

2059
01:24:53.800 --> 01:24:55.920
But they don't land on Stephanie and Johnny.
不过他们没有砸到斯蒂芬妮和强尼。

2060
01:24:56.060 --> 01:24:56.320
No.
没有。

2061
01:24:56.480 --> 01:24:58.400
Because they're no longer in the pool.
因为他们已经不在水池里了。

2062
01:24:58.580 --> 01:24:59.500
I guess they got out.
我猜他们上岸了。

2063
01:24:59.500 --> 01:25:00.420
Oh, my gosh, lady.
哦，天哪，大姐。

2064
01:25:00.540 --> 01:25:01.920
There's so much chatter online about it.
网上关于这个讨论得可热闹了。

2065
01:25:02.060 --> 01:25:06.940
People are like, okay, during the luau, people appear to disappear and appear on the boat
大家都在说，好吧，在夏威夷烤猪宴期间，有人一会儿消失又出现在船上，

2066
01:25:06.940 --> 01:25:08.980
and appear and disappear into the pool.
一会儿又出现在水池里然后又消失。

2067
01:25:09.180 --> 01:25:10.780
Some people fall in, then they're not there.
有些人掉进去了，然后人就不见了。

2068
01:25:10.900 --> 01:25:11.800
It's like a whole thing.
简直成了一大奇观。

2069
01:25:12.460 --> 01:25:15.600
Also, someone else pointed out, when the bike flips into the pool,
另外，还有人指出，当摩托车翻进水池时，

2070
01:25:15.800 --> 01:25:19.500
the cord that they use to make the bike flip is completely visible.
用来让摩托车翻转的绳索看得一清二楚。

2071
01:25:19.720 --> 01:25:20.160
Oh.
哦。

2072
01:25:20.160 --> 01:25:21.260
So there's that.
所以就是这样。

2073
01:25:21.560 --> 01:25:22.020
I see.
原来如此。

2074
01:25:22.660 --> 01:25:24.560
Well, I guess he did it.
好吧，我想他做到了。

2075
01:25:24.840 --> 01:25:25.920
He saved the day.
他拯救了大家。

2076
01:25:26.380 --> 01:25:27.520
It's really nuts.
真是太疯狂了。

2077
01:25:27.880 --> 01:25:31.480
The cycle lords could have ridden around the pool, but maybe not.
飞车领主本可以绕过水池骑过去，但也说不定。

2078
01:25:31.480 --> 01:25:32.840
I guess that's the challenge.
我猜这就是挑战所在。

2079
01:25:33.040 --> 01:25:35.900
That's how it works when you are cycle fighting.
飞车决斗就是这样的运作方式。

2080
01:25:36.400 --> 01:25:38.340
It's like, can you do the stunt or not?
就像是，你到底能不能完成这个特技？

2081
01:25:38.500 --> 01:25:38.680
Yeah.
是啊。

2082
01:25:39.120 --> 01:25:40.280
Stephanie's so excited.
斯蒂芬妮兴奋极了。

2083
01:25:40.480 --> 01:25:41.900
She's like, oh, my God, you're alive.
她就像是在说，哦，天哪，你还活着。

2084
01:25:42.160 --> 01:25:48.380
She takes off her crazy outfit they had her wear, and under it is not her sweatshirt.
她脱下了他们让她穿的疯狂行头，里面居然不是她的运动衫。

2085
01:25:48.380 --> 01:25:50.460
Yeah, now she has a cute outfit on.
对啊，现在她穿着一身可爱的衣服。

2086
01:25:50.620 --> 01:25:55.120
A silver lame, amazing shimmery dress slash unitard.
一件银色金属光泽、惊艳闪耀的连衣裤裙。

2087
01:25:56.200 --> 01:25:59.980
Michael, guys, now has a leather vest, collar up.
伙计们，迈克尔现在穿着皮背心，领子竖着。

2088
01:26:00.880 --> 01:26:01.700
No shirt.
没穿衬衫。

2089
01:26:02.100 --> 01:26:02.540
Obvi.
显而易见。

2090
01:26:02.980 --> 01:26:07.560
And at first, you guys, Johnny sees all of this, and he is so pissed off.
而且一开始，伙计们，强尼看到了这一切，他气炸了。

2091
01:26:07.700 --> 01:26:10.540
And he runs up to him, and he's like, you got one more jump.
他朝他跑过去，对他说，你还有最后一次跳跃。

2092
01:26:10.660 --> 01:26:12.740
And she's like, Johnny, hasn't there been enough?
然后她说，强尼，难道还不够吗？

2093
01:26:13.120 --> 01:26:16.340
And then the T-Birds are like, yeah, hasn't there been enough, Johnny?
接着雷鸟党也说，是啊，难道还不够吗，强尼？

2094
01:26:16.500 --> 01:26:17.400
Hasn't there been enough?
难道还不够吗？

2095
01:26:17.400 --> 01:26:20.600
And then he's like, and then he's like, jacket.
然后他说，然后他说，夹克。

2096
01:26:21.020 --> 01:26:22.980
And Paulette's like, jacket.
波莱特也说，夹克。

2097
01:26:23.440 --> 01:26:29.180
And then he gets the jacket, and then he gives it to Michael, and he's made Michael a T-Bird.
接着他拿到了夹克，然后把它送给了迈克尔，他让迈克尔成了雷鸟党的一员。

2098
01:26:29.380 --> 01:26:32.820
And now he and Stephanie, they can be together.
现在他和斯蒂芬妮终于可以在一起了。

2099
01:26:33.100 --> 01:26:33.720
They can.
他们可以的。

2100
01:26:34.540 --> 01:26:36.600
And there's going to be a lot of coupledom.
接下来将会充满成双成对的甜蜜。

2101
01:26:36.840 --> 01:26:39.160
The final song is called We'll Be Together.
最后一首歌叫作《我们将在一起》。

2102
01:26:39.740 --> 01:26:41.040
Everyone is dancing.
每个人都在跳舞。

2103
01:26:41.360 --> 01:26:45.940
And this song wins Closest Singing in Each Other's Faces Award.
这首歌赢得了“贴脸对唱奖”。

2104
01:26:45.940 --> 01:26:50.560
Yeah, there's a lot of spinning, singing into each other's faces.
对，有大量旋转，还有面对着脸互相对唱。

2105
01:26:50.780 --> 01:26:52.040
But I'm talking like maybe.
但我说的是大概。

2106
01:26:52.300 --> 01:26:53.000
Lip to lip.
唇枪舌剑……不对，嘴唇贴着嘴唇。

2107
01:26:53.000 --> 01:26:54.420
Like two fingers.
就像两根手指。

2108
01:26:54.620 --> 01:26:56.020
Put two fingers up to your lips.
把两根手指放到嘴唇上。

2109
01:26:56.220 --> 01:26:56.460
Yep.
没错。

2110
01:26:56.800 --> 01:26:59.620
And then imagine someone else's face on the other side of your finger.
然后想象在你的手指另一边是另一个人的脸。

2111
01:26:59.760 --> 01:27:00.400
Singing at you.
冲着你唱歌。

2112
01:27:00.400 --> 01:27:01.460
Singing, full voice.
放声歌唱。

2113
01:27:01.680 --> 01:27:03.100
I have an audio clip.
我有一段音频。

2114
01:27:03.100 --> 01:27:09.600
It has a little bit of dialogue between Stephanie and Michael, and then it leads into the top of this song.
里面有斯蒂芬妮和迈克尔之间的一小段对话，然后就进入了这首歌的开头。

2115
01:27:10.320 --> 01:27:12.980
I never thought you'd kiss me like that if you knew what I really was.
我从没想过你会那样吻我，如果你知道我真正的样子的话。

2116
01:27:13.620 --> 01:27:14.880
Are you crazy?
你疯了吗？

2117
01:27:16.060 --> 01:27:17.580
I'm at two for the price of one.
我这是买一赠一。

2118
01:27:19.560 --> 01:27:20.200
You certain?
你确定吗？

2119
01:27:21.280 --> 01:27:22.680
I've never been certain.
我从来没确定过。

2120
01:27:24.240 --> 01:27:24.820
What's that?
那是什么？

2121
01:27:27.300 --> 01:27:28.260
The certaineSt.
最确定。

2122
01:27:28.720 --> 01:27:29.720
The certainest?
最确定？

2123
01:27:30.640 --> 01:27:31.640
Yeah, I like that.
对，我喜欢这个词。

2124
01:27:33.770 --> 01:27:34.990
I'd love to kiss you again.
我很想再吻你一次。

2125
01:27:36.820 --> 01:27:42.660
Yeah, I would have suggested that they cut that dialogue before the singing.
对，我本建议他们在唱歌前把那段对话剪掉。

2126
01:27:43.440 --> 01:27:48.880
Because again, Michael, what are you seeing in her?
因为话说回来，迈克尔，你到底看上她哪一点了？

2127
01:27:49.060 --> 01:27:50.960
This is the woman for you?
这就是你的真命天女？

2128
01:27:51.600 --> 01:27:54.680
Lady, I love this movie so much now.
天哪，现在我太喜欢这部电影了。

2129
01:27:54.900 --> 01:27:58.420
And I am the certainest of it.
对此我无比确定。

2130
01:28:02.630 --> 01:28:03.710
I hear you.
我懂你的意思。

2131
01:28:03.810 --> 01:28:04.350
You know what?
你知道吗？

2132
01:28:04.590 --> 01:28:07.050
He accepts her where she is.
他接受了她原本的样子。

2133
01:28:07.210 --> 01:28:07.810
That's right.
没错。

2134
01:28:07.810 --> 01:28:08.770
That's the love.
这就是真爱。

2135
01:28:08.930 --> 01:28:10.010
He's like, I love you.
他的意思是，我爱你。

2136
01:28:10.270 --> 01:28:11.390
You dum-dum.
你这个小笨蛋。

2137
01:28:14.050 --> 01:28:15.710
Can I please kiss you again?
我能再吻你一次吗？

2138
01:28:16.710 --> 01:28:18.010
Maybe he's like, don't speak.
也许他的意思是，别说话。

2139
01:28:18.330 --> 01:28:18.730
Don't speak.
别说话。

2140
01:28:19.850 --> 01:28:21.370
Can we go back to the kissing?
我们能回到接吻上来吗？

2141
01:28:22.370 --> 01:28:24.230
I love you so much when we're kissing.
我太喜欢我们接吻的时候了。

2142
01:28:24.590 --> 01:28:26.210
And she's like, you don't need to talk to me.
而她的意思是，你不需要跟我说话。

2143
01:28:26.390 --> 01:28:27.570
Just let me ride on your motorcycle.
只要让我坐在你的摩托车上就行。

2144
01:28:28.030 --> 01:28:30.030
Maybe this is a relationship in silence.
也许这是一段无声的恋情。

2145
01:28:31.310 --> 01:28:34.430
Well, this whole thing is going to morph into graduation.
好了，这一切将过渡到毕业典礼。

2146
01:28:35.010 --> 01:28:37.250
Now we're back outside Rydell High.
现在我们回到了赖德尔高中外面。

2147
01:28:37.250 --> 01:28:40.190
Everyone's in caps and gowns in front of the school.
每个人都穿着学士服、戴着学士帽站在学校前面。

2148
01:28:40.430 --> 01:28:42.590
They're throwing their caps in the air.
他们把帽子扔向空中。

2149
01:28:42.950 --> 01:28:48.370
Everyone's singing toward the camera, except for Stephanie and Michael, who are still singing right into each other's faces.
每个人都对着镜头唱歌，除了斯蒂芬妮和迈克尔，他们依然面对面地互相对唱。

2150
01:28:49.170 --> 01:28:53.170
And then we're going to have this final montage that I've always loved.
然后我们将迎来我一直很喜欢的最后这个蒙太奇。

2151
01:28:53.230 --> 01:28:57.270
It starts with the whole group of people running toward the camera.
开始时是所有人一起朝着镜头跑来。

2152
01:28:57.430 --> 01:28:59.570
They jump in the air, and it's like a freeze frame.
他们跳到空中，画面就像定格了一样。

2153
01:29:00.010 --> 01:29:02.790
And that sort of becomes like a yearbook picture.
这有点像毕业纪念册的照片。

2154
01:29:03.030 --> 01:29:03.230
Yeah.
对。

2155
01:29:03.230 --> 01:29:15.210
And then you see everybody kind of coupled up in their couple pairs, and they run toward the camera kind of in slow motion, and they do some sort of fun jump, and it freezes.
然后你看到每个人都成双成对地朝着镜头慢动作奔跑，他们做了一个有趣的跳跃动作，然后画面定格。

2156
01:29:15.630 --> 01:29:17.190
And that's part of the yearbook.
这也是毕业纪念册的一部分。

2157
01:29:17.370 --> 01:29:17.870
Yes.
是的。

2158
01:29:18.530 --> 01:29:21.390
There were two alternate endings for this movie.
这部电影有两个备用结局。

2159
01:29:22.070 --> 01:29:23.650
Would you like to hear them?
你想听听吗？

2160
01:29:23.770 --> 01:29:24.890
I can't wait.
我都等不及了。

2161
01:29:25.170 --> 01:29:25.570
Okay.
好的。

2162
01:29:25.870 --> 01:29:37.450
So, one alternate ending had Michael and Stephanie flying off into the sky on a motorcycle, which would have mirrored Danny and Sandy flying off in the car at the end of Greece.
其中一个备用结局是迈克尔和斯蒂芬妮骑着摩托车飞向天空，这呼应了《油脂》结尾时丹尼和桑迪开车飞走的场景。

2163
01:29:38.090 --> 01:29:39.570
They didn't do that.
他们没有那样做。

2164
01:29:39.910 --> 01:29:41.010
But also,
不过，

2165
01:29:41.310 --> 01:29:53.070
Patricia Birch proposed an idea to feature John Travolta and Olivia Newton-John reprising their characters as a now-married couple running a gas station at the end of the movie,
帕特里夏·伯奇提出了一个想法，即让约翰·特拉沃尔塔和奥莉维亚·牛顿-约翰重新扮演他们的角色，以已婚夫妇的身份在电影结尾经营一家加油站，

2166
01:29:53.070 --> 01:29:58.150
and it would have even involved John Travolta singing a new number called Gas Pump Jockey.
甚至还包括约翰·特拉沃尔塔演唱一首名为《加油机管理员》的新歌。

2167
01:29:58.350 --> 01:30:00.550
But this did not come to fruition.
但这并没有实现。

2168
01:30:00.650 --> 01:30:04.150
So, I guess there was the option to end the movie with a little cameo.
所以，我想当时确实可以选择以一个小客串来结束这部电影。

2169
01:30:04.330 --> 01:30:07.150
So, I guess they would have ridden their motorcycle together.
所以，我想他们会一起骑着摩托车。

2170
01:30:07.450 --> 01:30:07.790
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

2171
01:30:07.970 --> 01:30:11.010
To Danny and Sandy's gas station.
去丹尼和桑迪的加油站。

2172
01:30:11.610 --> 01:30:11.710
Yeah.
对。

2173
01:30:11.890 --> 01:30:13.130
And there would have been this little reunion.
然后会有这样一个小小的重聚。

2174
01:30:13.350 --> 01:30:14.150
I guess.
我猜吧。

2175
01:30:14.330 --> 01:30:15.370
With a whole song.
还有一整首歌。

2176
01:30:15.610 --> 01:30:18.090
How does Gas Pump Jockey go?
《加油机管理员》是怎么唱的？

2177
01:30:18.350 --> 01:30:19.210
I don't know.
我不知道。

2178
01:30:20.190 --> 01:30:25.530
Speaking of songs, so you watched this movie for the first time.
说到歌曲，你这是第一次看这部电影。

2179
01:30:25.730 --> 01:30:26.430
Last week.
上周。

2180
01:30:26.670 --> 01:30:26.930
Yes.
是的。

2181
01:30:27.170 --> 01:30:27.230
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

2182
01:30:27.550 --> 01:30:28.890
Aren't the songs so catchy?
这些歌是不是很洗脑？

2183
01:30:29.070 --> 01:30:35.230
You know these songs are good because you hear them once, and you can sing, I Want to Score Tonight.
你知道这些歌很好，因为你听过一次，就能唱出《我今晚要得分》。

2184
01:30:35.250 --> 01:30:37.090
You can sing, Let's Do It for Our Country.
你能唱出《为了我们的国家，我们干吧》。

2185
01:30:37.450 --> 01:30:40.550
You know these songs after one time watching the movie.
看了一遍电影后，你就知道这些歌了。

2186
01:30:40.770 --> 01:30:45.410
Driving in here today, I was singing, I'm going to score tonight.
今天开车来这儿的路上，我一直在唱“我今晚要得分”。

2187
01:30:45.690 --> 01:30:46.130
Exactly.
正是如此。

2188
01:30:46.650 --> 01:30:47.450
It's great.
太棒了。

2189
01:30:47.790 --> 01:30:48.030
Yeah.
对。

2190
01:30:48.070 --> 01:30:49.030
That's a great musical.
那是一部很棒的音乐剧。

2191
01:30:49.310 --> 01:30:51.250
That is a really fun musical.
那真是一部非常有趣的音乐剧。

2192
01:30:51.250 --> 01:30:53.610
And really, Greece, too, has everything.
而且说实话，《油脂》里什么都有。

2193
01:30:53.950 --> 01:30:55.550
It's got Russia.
里面有俄罗斯。

2194
01:30:56.130 --> 01:30:59.010
It's got fallout shelters.
里面有防空洞。

2195
01:30:59.070 --> 01:31:02.130
It's got lots of cigarettes.
里面有大量的香烟。

2196
01:31:02.990 --> 01:31:04.670
Lots of gum.
还有大量的口香糖。

2197
01:31:04.910 --> 01:31:08.470
Gum and stiff-collared shirts.
口香糖和硬领衬衫。

2198
01:31:08.790 --> 01:31:08.990
Yeah.
对。

2199
01:31:09.370 --> 01:31:11.290
You guys, I highly recommend it.
伙计们，我强烈推荐它。

2200
01:31:11.810 --> 01:31:13.610
And I also want to say thank you today.
我今天还想说声谢谢。

2201
01:31:13.610 --> 01:31:17.210
In the booth, we have Jordan filling in for Sam.
演播室里，由乔丹代替萨姆。

2202
01:31:17.490 --> 01:31:18.390
Thank you, Jordan.
谢谢你，乔丹。

2203
01:31:18.750 --> 01:31:19.410
You're welcome.
不客气。

2204
01:31:19.430 --> 01:31:24.910
I was so excited to be helping with this episode because I grew up avidly watching Greece, too.
我非常兴奋能参与这期节目的制作，因为我从小也狂热地看《油脂2》。

2205
01:31:25.510 --> 01:31:26.990
How many times have you seen it?
你看过多少遍？

2206
01:31:27.270 --> 01:31:28.050
Oh, many times.
哦，很多遍。

2207
01:31:28.170 --> 01:31:30.210
I had a vinyl of it growing up.
我从小就有一张它的黑胶唱片。

2208
01:31:30.210 --> 01:31:32.250
Because my parents, they graduated in 72.
因为我的父母，他们是72届的。

2209
01:31:32.690 --> 01:31:37.270
I literally, my dad rode a motorcycle and worked on them his entire life.
我真的，我爸爸骑了一辈子摩托车，也修了一辈子摩托车。

2210
01:31:37.470 --> 01:31:40.810
I have pictures of him doing wheelies and next to, like, motorcycles.
我有他玩翘头以及和摩托车合影的照片。

2211
01:31:41.090 --> 01:31:43.050
Your dad was a cool writer, Jordan.
你爸爸是个酷车手，乔丹。

2212
01:31:43.290 --> 01:31:44.490
He was a Thunderbird.
他是个雷鸟车队成员。

2213
01:31:44.830 --> 01:31:46.450
He was a Thunderbird.
他是个雷鸟车队成员。

2214
01:31:46.690 --> 01:31:48.950
And Matt is here all the way from San Francisco.
马特也大老远从旧金山赶来了。

2215
01:31:48.950 --> 01:31:50.390
Matt, thanks for being here today.
马特，谢谢你今天能来。

2216
01:31:50.570 --> 01:31:51.170
This was great.
这太棒了。

2217
01:31:51.350 --> 01:31:52.550
This was very fun to watch.
看这个非常有意思。

2218
01:31:52.670 --> 01:31:56.930
My sister and I are Greece purists, so we never really delved into this.
我和我姐姐是《油脂》的纯粹主义者，所以我们从没真正涉足过这部。

2219
01:31:57.030 --> 01:31:59.090
So this was interesting to watch.
所以看这个很有意思。

2220
01:31:59.110 --> 01:32:00.090
I had a good time.
我度过了一段美好的时光。

2221
01:32:00.620 --> 01:32:04.990
Well, I want to say a thank you to Nathan for suggesting this movie.
嗯，我要感谢内森推荐了这部电影。

2222
01:32:05.890 --> 01:32:07.130
Hit us up, guys.
联系我们吧，各位。

2223
01:32:07.370 --> 01:32:09.630
Let us know, what do you want us to watch?
让我们知道，你们想让我们看什么？

2224
01:32:09.730 --> 01:32:11.190
Because we like watching stuff together.
因为我们喜欢一起看东西。

2225
01:32:11.570 --> 01:32:12.630
We really do.
我们真的很喜欢。

2226
01:32:12.870 --> 01:32:18.030
I couldn't have predicted half of the plot lines for Greece, too.
我根本预料不到《油脂2》里一半的剧情走向。

2227
01:32:18.590 --> 01:32:19.870
It was a real adventure.
这真是一场冒险。

2228
01:32:20.070 --> 01:32:24.590
And I hope you guys all score tonight, whatever that means to you.
我希望你们今晚都能有所收获，无论对你们意味着什么。

2229
01:32:25.050 --> 01:32:27.450
We love you, and we'll see you next week.
我们爱你们，我们下周见。

2230
01:32:27.790 --> 01:32:33.250
Oh, that's a delight.
哦，这太令人高兴了。

2231
01:32:33.250 --> 01:32:34.350
I love doing it.
我喜欢做这个。

2232
01:32:34.470 --> 01:32:34.910
Me, too.
我也是。

2233
01:32:37.770 --> 01:32:39.390
Thank you for listening to Office Ladies.
感谢收听《办公室女士》。

2234
01:32:39.730 --> 01:32:44.790
Office Ladies is a presentation of Odyssey and is produced by Jenna Fisher and Angela Kinsey.
《办公室女士》是奥德赛的节目，由珍娜·费舍尔和安吉拉·金西制作。

2235
01:32:44.970 --> 01:32:46.990
Our senior producer is Matt Beagle.
我们的资深制作人是马特·比格尔。

2236
01:32:47.250 --> 01:32:49.210
And our audio engineer is Sam Kiefer.
我们的音频工程师是萨姆·基弗。

2237
01:32:49.490 --> 01:32:52.030
Odyssey's executive producer is Leah Reese Dennis.
奥德赛的执行制作人是莉亚·里斯·丹尼斯。

2238
01:32:52.470 --> 01:32:55.290
Office Ladies was mixed and mastered by Bill Schultz.
《办公室女士》由比尔·舒尔茨进行混音和母带制作。

2239
01:32:55.290 --> 01:32:58.290
Our theme song is Rupertree by Creed Bratton.
我们的主题曲是克里德·布拉顿创作的鲁珀特树。

2240
01:32:58.430 --> 01:32:58.730
We'll see you next week.
我们下周见。

2241
01:32:58.730 --> 01:32:58.830
We'll see you next week.
我们下周见。
